					say "You sense an odd heat, and strange squirming sensation rippling through you in tandem with the vibrant flare of her eyes. Though only briefly as her doll's lips turn into a pronounced frown. 'Sorry Pet, you don't have enough essence for that.' she say, dishearteningly.";
	else: 
		say "    Despite your attempts to speak with her, Snuggle remains impossibly silent, perhaps she's ignoring you in your current state, or maybe without your proper vulpine form, you simply can't 'hear' her? Regardless, something tells you that unless your change back into your snuggly foxy body the odd ooze won't be speakig woth you anytime soon.";

to say eyesonly:
	say "     'Daw, we had hoped Pet liked her eyes just the way they are, but if she desires that we change them it will take but a moment of her time.' Snuggle preens, flexing a pair of gelatinous fingers outward into a classical peace sign as twin beads of darkening magenta pool on their tips. 'So tell us Precious Pet, what color would you like your eyes to be? A vibrant green, rich crimson, luminous gold, striking pink, placid blue, or a more common brown?' she intones, leveling her fingers with your snoot, as the dots swirl upon before you, their surfaces shifting with her every word. 'Of course, if necessary we can always return them to the brilliant magenta we first gifted you,' she hums, her otherwise bright and airy tune tainted by the cutting sour note as she fixes you with an expectant stare.";
	LineBreak;
	say "[italic type]What color would your like your eyes to be?[roman type]";
	LineBreak;
	let sad_fox_noise_Choices be a list of text;
	add "Magenta." to sad_fox_noise_Choices; 
	add "Tell her you want green eyes." to sad_fox_noise_Choices; 
	add "Inform her you desire blue ones." to sad_fox_noise_Choices;
	add "Explain that you crave crimson orbs." to sad_fox_noise_Choices;
	add "Request pink spheres." to sad_fox_noise_Choices;
	add "Inquire about gold oculus." to sad_fox_noise_Choices;
	add "Ask for brown eyes." to sad_fox_noise_Choices;
	let sad_fox_noise_Choice be what the player chooses from sad_fox_noise_Choices;
	if sad_fox_noise_Choice is:
		-- "Magenta.":
			say "[donotaskquestions]";
			now intelligence of Mistress Snuggle is 0;
		-- "Tell her you want green eyes.":
			say "[donotaskquestions]";
			now intelligence of Mistress Snuggle is 1;
		-- "Inform her you desire blue ones.":
			say "[donotaskquestions]";
			now intelligence of Mistress Snuggle is 2;
		-- "Explain that you crave crimson orbs.":
			say "[donotaskquestions]";
			now intelligence of Mistress Snuggle is 3;
		-- "Request pink spheres.":
			say "[donotaskquestions]";
			now intelligence of Mistress Snuggle is 4;
		-- "Inquire about gold oculus.":
			say "[donotaskquestions]";
			now intelligence of Mistress Snuggle is 5;
		-- "Ask for brown eyes.":
			say "[donotaskquestions]";
			now intelligence of Mistress Snuggle is 6;

to say donotaskquestions:
	say "     'Excellent choice Pet,' Snuggle hums, with a light circular flourish of her doll's wrist as the evershift of the twin droplets balanced atop its fingers snap into your hue. 'Now open your eyes as wide as you can,' she simpers craning her elastic arm above your head. Nodding, you do as instructed and clasp your finger to your eyelids, forcing them wide. 'Good girl, don't blink now,' she says, her flicking digits toward you and sending the goopy beads flying. As they land with a muted patter, as if rain were bouncing off an umbrella while your world darkens and vision constricts like you're staring through a fine mesh. Internally wincing as the ooze filters through, you're hit with a strong urge to blink away the goop, and the warning of the odd gell, keeps you from doing so. 'There-there, just hold on a few seconds more,' Snuggle whispers in a soothing cadence, as she reaches down and wipes aside a few ooze tinted tears streaming down the side of your face.";
	say "     Grunting, you nibble upon your lower lip, desperately trying to ignore the sensation of syrupy gel impregnating your irises as your eyes twitch and tear ducts swell with intrusion. But only briefly, as the blinding bands cast across your gaze recede while blessed lumens pour through the gaps, till, at last your vision clears, and Snuggle purrs. 'There we go dear, you can blink now.' in a reassuring trill as her doll shrinks back down to its normal size. Thank you, you murmur, gleefully clenching your eyes shut, relishing the diminished sense of pressure fluttering across them as blink away any excess ooze. 'Of course dear, and since you were so very brave and obedient, we think you deserve a little treat.' Snuggle teases, cuddling her doll beside you.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     Oh what kind of treat, you reply, happily wagging your tail behind as the sultry ooze runs a finger along flanks. 'Why a nice hug from your Mistress,' she replies, with an airy chuckle as soft bands of balmy goo coil about your waist. Sublimely silky to the touch, a part of you can't help but yip excitedly at inviting caress circling about as the gentle gel nuzzles her willow snout against you. Sighing contentedly, you practically melt into her embrace as the syrupy fronds of expansive form your bountiful, caringly stroking your fur and massage any lingering patches of tension clinging to you. 'See feels good doesn't it sweetie,' the slutty gel hums, tucking her doll's chin along the ample hills of your [breast size desc of Player] cleavage, fixing you with a loving stare. Yes Snuggle, you mumble a near dream cadence. 'Good, precious Pets like you were meant to be spoiled and fawned over,' she simpers, eyes twinkling a creamy pink as she snakes her neck upward, lavishing opulent tits and regal fur with a loving flurry of kisses till your gazes meet.";
	say "      Snickering, you lean forward and the goopy fox a quick peck of your own, while thanking the dotting ooze for her words, and, you pause, fluttering a tail beside your enhanced orbs, the wonderful work she's done. 'Think nothing of it pet, your comfort and happiness is all that matters to us.' Snuggle blushes, her doll's cheeks glowing a brilliant crimson. Blushing in turn, you draw your paws about her avatar, groping a cheeky pawful of welcoming goo, drawing a cute lewd yip from the sultry slimes as your claws explore her supple ass. 'Naughty girl, if you're feeling pent up, perhaps we can help with that too.' Snuggle teases, lightly batting your paws aside with a flick of her tail and motions towards her true body with a bat of her ears.";

to say dyejob:
	say "     'Simple enough Pet, what color would you like your pretty pelt to be?' Snuggle beams, with a gentle flick of her ears. 'A touch of black to go with your fishnets. Some grey to help you stalk your prey in this drab concrete jungle? Wondrous gold to show off your friends? A dash of sliver to match your cute widdle tumby fur? Perhaps a splash of sandy yellow to brighten your day? Or an exotic blue to stand out in a crowd,' she queries, as her doll takes a seat upon the quivering mass of her true body, while it waits for your reply.";
	LineBreak;
	say "     [italic type]What color fur would you like[roman type]?";
	let fur_on_da_beach_Choices be a list of text;
	add "Black." to fur_on_da_beach_Choices; 
	add "Grey." to fur_on_da_beach_Choices;
	add "Gold." to fur_on_da_beach_Choices;
	add "Silver." to fur_on_da_beach_Choices;
	add "Yellow." to fur_on_da_beach_Choices;
	add "Blue." to fur_on_da_beach_Choices;
	let fur_on_da_beach_Choice be what the player chooses from fur_on_da_beach_Choices;
	if fur_on_da_beach_Choice is:
		-- "Black.":
			say "[IDKfurstuff]";
			now Libido of Mistress Snuggle is 2;
		-- "Grey.":
			say "[IDKfurstuff]";
			now Libido of Mistress Snuggle is 3;
		-- "Gold.":
			say "[IDKfurstuff]";
			now Libido of Mistress Snuggle is 1;
		-- "Silver.":
			say "[IDKfurstuff]";
			now Libido of Mistress Snuggle is 4;
		-- "Yellow.":
			say "[IDKfurstuff]";
			now Libido of Mistress Snuggle is 5;
		-- "Blue.":
			say "[IDKfurstuff]";
			now Libido of Mistress Snuggle is 6;


to say IDKfurstuff:
	say "     'If that is what Pet wishes, now come, take a seat and let Mistress work her magic,' Snuggle hums, while her doll invitingly pats the amorphous ooze beside itself. Eagerly wagging your tail, [if player is impreg_now]you thoughtlessly drape you paws along the luxurious swell of your fluffy baby bump. Delighting in the ever present softness greeting your pads and the euphoric sense of pride coursing through as you run your hands along the subtle outlines of your cubs as waddle to her side[else]as you strut over to her side[end if]. Then seat yourself upon the proffered gel with a contented hum as her true body conforms your lovey curves.  'Comfy,' she simpers, as silky tendrils slink out of her goopy body and coil about your tender peets, lovingly massaging your cushy pads and beastly ankles, working out any lingering tension or kinks clinging to your opulent form. Yes Snuggle, you dreamily purr, laying into her embrace.";
	say "     'Good Girl,' she preens, stretching her elastic legs around your cuddly as nestles her doll against you in a gentle full body hug. Refreshingly cool to the touch, the welcome silky caress of her elastic being seeps across your pelt like a living glove, blanketing your eager form in a veil of shimmering magenta. Rather chuffed by the sight, you encouragingly draw your arms about the doting doll, eager to feel the sense of weightlessness and safety her touch brings, moaning. So soft, while you run your finger down the small of her back. 'Pet is too kind,' Snuggle hums, nuzzling her snout along the your neck as her gel spreads over extremities, encapsulating much of your matronly form while she eases you onto your back. 'And pretty too,' she swoons, watching the pleasantly yet subtle bounce of your ample assets as her alien currents wash over you.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "    Blushing, you whisper your appreciation for her work, noting how few infections bring you the same manner of joy as your cuddly vulpine body does. 'Thank you Pet, but working with such fine clay is a pleasure like no other,' she titters as her true body pulls you all the deeper into herself. Unbothered, even as her slimy figure creeps up your neck, you merely nod and voice your eagerness to see what wonders she can work on you. 'Oh Pet, flattery will get you everywhere,' she chuckles as she looms over you and plants a single kiss on the borders of your two toned neck fur. Lighter than a feather, your senses barely even register her touch beyond a mild static tickle dancing along your carotid that soon flows outward in a subtle spiderweb of sensation across your fur."; 
	say "     All the while, Snuggle's body ripples about as you as wild sparks of triboluminescence winks along your fur. An oddly cold, alloyed with a queer numbness seeps out from this chromatic fissure as your pelt begins to shift towards your favored hue. 'Mh such beauty,' she purrs, while her doll's fingers flow through the fine membrane of her true self, stroking and tracing the spreading colors as if to urge them on. Curious and comfy in equal measure, you relax into her hold, watching the changes billow across you. As the original hue covering much of your torso vanishes before your eyes, though the process begins to slow once it nears your limbs. '*Tsk* stubborn machines, always needing another push. No matter, they'll bend to us whether they like it or not!' Snuggle hisses, gilding her goopy talons['] along an unchanged patch of hair nestled upon your shoulder. In their wake, the cold numbness gripping your grows in intensity as the chill shifts to a feverish tropical balm filters though you.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     Muted bubbles velvety of white steam begin to percolate about your extremities as your form tightness and compress with each passing second, growing just hair more slender. While the fecund abundance coddling your foxy figure is consumed by the aberrant effect of Mistress Snuggle's influence coursing through you.  ";
	if "boring fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "A part of can't help but internal cheer as much of the unsightly pudge melts away, revealing a sleek, slender with just a hit of vulpine curves. You preen, idly fanning your legs in open admiration of your beastly figure and the welcome sense of lightness cascading through you.";
	else if "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "Some section of your mind still bemoans the loss of your milfy burgeoning splendor, after all that hard earned warm cuddly floof felt so right on you, like your whole body was wrapped in a big comfy blanket. To lose even a single inch of your pillowy padding almost makes you growl. While you watch in pure dismay as your opulent adipose boils away, leaving only yucky muscle in its wake. You muse, pawing that your willowy legs as hints of gross mannish muscle peak out from beneath your fur as your precious pounds evaporate.";
	else:
		say "You can only look on with a sense of curious detachment while your body deflates by the second as excess vulpine calories and latent nanite potent stored within your ample body is swallowed in the wave of change sweeping over you. Distantly, you can only imagine what manner of madness must be going on inside you to rewrite your form's code, much less how Snuggle is able to so effectively handle a task most might think impossible. Not that the hows or whys matter, you ruminate briefly casting your gaze towards your slimming waist line as hips tighten and calves are remold into more a compact form.";
	say "All the while, the goopy doll's visage contorts into an unusual palsy-like grimace, its ears and lips seem to sag to one side as whatever private war it's waging against the nanites seems to be taking its toll. Here and there, sections of her shoulders away as goats of steam seep out of her collar. Yet, the ooze remains intent on its task despite the growing loss of stability to wracking its avatar, as its fingers lose cohesion and dissolve back into her true body with the fizzing pop. In places, you can even see its main mass recede as it's gripped by some manner of alien autophagy. Never once though does it slacked in its task as the shifting hues of fur spread outward like oil churning along waves while islands of color crash, then blend into one another.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     To your eyes, the roiling pigments almost seem to be warring as hues and new begin to swirl together in a near hypnotic ballet, till the colors seem to pop and flatten into your chosen tone. '*Ah-Ah* f-fei-fiesty little automata,' Snuggle gasps, her doll collapsing against your shoulder with a pitiful whimper. Concerned, you run your hand along the back of her head, asking if she's going to be alright. 'Yes P-pet, we just... so tired, please will you hold us? It is hard to, hard to...' she murmurs, body flattening like a spoilt souffle as the doll's snoot falls limply across your shoulder. Nodding, you caringly cradle her for a spell, worriedly patting her back while she reforms. Little-by-little, the arms solidify about your waist while her avatar's face suddenly snaps about into place with a rubbery twang as she staggers back, lips curled into a proud grim, humming. 'It is done,' motioning to your altered pelt with a fanciful flourish of her goopy tail.";
	say "    It appears so, but what happened, you ask. 'Hm, how best to explain,' Snuggle hums tapping a goopy paw along the floor in a thoughtful tattoo, 'it takes a great deal of concentration to mold Pet's nanites to our will, so much so that holding our doll together was becoming... taxing. Still,' she beams, 'so long as precious Pet is happy, Mistress would gladly sacrifice a trillion dolls just to see her smile.' Touched, you offer your thanks to the loving gel, but also ask that she not overexert herself on your account. 'Pet is kind, but her concern is unnecessary,' Snuggle coos, as her doll leans over and gives your gentle pat on the head, while ooze swaddling you recedes and her remaining mass hefts you to your paws with surprising ease. 'We trust Pet likes our work though?' the goo asks with delighted twinkle in their crimson eyes. Tilting your gaze to better drink in the sight of freshly dyed fur, you tell her yes, very much so in fact. 'Then we are pleased and eager to assist Pet again, though if be so kind as to share her bounty with her Mistress, we would be most appreciative.' she purrs, invitingly gesturing to her true body while she waits for your reply.";
	Decrease Perception of Mistress Snuggle by 1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 2 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
	else if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 3 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
		StatChange "Charisma" by -1;
	else if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 4 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Strength" by -3;
		StatChange "charisma" by -3;
	else if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 5 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
		StatChange "Charisma" by -1;
		StatChange "Dexterity" by -1;



to say highlights:
	say "     'A wondrous choice dear, we had meant to gift you with some extra color when you reunited us, but we lacked the,' she pauses, her doll's ears a twitch with an aggravated energy, 'vision we do now. So tell us beloved Pet, what manner of accents should we bestow you? We could perhaps inscribe upon you some nordic runes, who knows it might impress some of the local vikings,' she snickers, tail wagging behind in a mischievous tattoo. 'Though a trail of brilliant blue lightening might suit your taste better, and it would certainly compliment your pretty white fur,' she preens, eyeing up the lustrous borders of your furs with obvious interest. 'Then again, if Pet wishes it, we could gift them a verdant crown of thorns upon their fur, or emblazon you with the marks of a chaotic plane glimpsed only by the mad and enlightened.' she proffers with a coiling trill. 'Lastly,' she shrugs, 'should you require it, we can always wash away any embellishments if Pet ever tires of them.'";
	LineBreak;
	say "    [bold type]How do you respond[roman type]?";
	LineBreak;
	let filler_shit_Choices be a list of text;
	if thirst of Mistress Snuggle > 1:
		add "Remove your marks." to filler_shit_Choices;
	add "Coat yourself in nordic runes." to filler_shit_Choices;
	add "Embazon your fur in brilliant blue lightning." to filler_shit_Choices;
	add "Have Snuggle draw thorny vines of your pelt." to filler_shit_Choices;
	add "Alloy yourself in the language of madness." to filler_shit_Choices;
	let filler_shit_Choice be what the player chooses from filler_shit_Choices;
	if filler_shit_Choice is:
		-- "Remove your marks.":
			say "[whiteboard]";
			now thirst of Mistress Snuggle is 0;
		-- "Coat yourself in nordic runes.":
			say "[whiteboard]";
			now thirst of Mistress Snuggle is 1;
		-- "Embazon your fur in brilliant blue lightning.":
			say "[whiteboard]";
			now thirst of Mistress Snuggle is 2;
		-- "Have Snuggle draw thorny vines of your pelt.":
			say "[whiteboard]";
			now thirst of Mistress Snuggle is 3;
		-- "Alloy yourself in the language of madness.":
			say "[whiteboard]";
			now thirst of Mistress Snuggle is 4;


to say whiteboard:
	say "       'My pleasure precious, we do so enjoy sculpting our Pet into the priceless work of art she was meant to be,' Snuggle crows, flickering her doll's left index with an audible '[italic type]shwing[roman type]'. As you watch with unvarnished curiosity the digit curving outward into a subtle crook, while the tip of her finger loses a measure of its cohesion and sags slightly downward like a dollop of drying paint. The goopy fox struts towards purring, 'Do be a dear and hold still Pet, we would so hate to mar our perfect girl's lovely pelt,' angling her elongated like-brush digit along the edges of your flanks. Naturally, you simper, with a knowing nod as you present your eager body to the budding artist. ";
	if player is impreg_now:
		say "'Stars Pet how spoil us with such vast, ample canvas,' she swoons, brushing her finger along the supple curves of your opulent baby bump, drawing a cute girly giggle from your lips as the cool soothing gel seeps across your taut tummy fur. Hey you're not that big, you snicker, cheeks flaring a vibrant crimson."; 
		say "     'Oh Pet no need to be bashful, you should be proud of your curves. Why,' she pauses, cupping a gelatinous paw under the glowing hem of your pearly paunch, 'just think how comfy your kits must be cuddled inside this [if perception of Mistress Snuggle is 1]tender widdle tumby[else if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 2]adorable foxy tum[else if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 3]big beautiful bubbly belly[else if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 4]fluffy fox factory[else if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 5]big fat greedy gut[end if].' she titters, cheerfully drumming her finger along the supple hem of your tightening middle, sending soft little ripples through your pearly fur as your kits kick in reply to her touch. 'Daw how cute, did we wake you dears?' Snuggle preens, lightly tracing a finger around the impression of their adorable paws flickering across your fur.";
		WaitLineBreak;
		say "     Seems like it, or maybe they just like the attention, you giggle, relishing the gel's gentle caress and heady rush of motherly hormones coursing through while they stir. 'Well who could blame them dear, Pet's cubs deserve all the love in the world, just like their cuddly mommy. Now isn't that right?' she hums, fixing you with an approving look. Nodding, as your tail wags behind, you gush in agreement, noting how you hope your kits enjoy her work. 'As do we, Pet deserves to have the prettiest preds around, after all nothing is too good for you and your pups.' Snuggle teases, giving your tummy fur an affectionate tussle, drawing a pleased yip from your lips as her palm glides down along your opulent middle. 'Perhaps when we're done we can treat you to a lovely meal, or a widdle quality time. For the moment though, do try to hold still dear, the first stroke is always the hardest.' she snickers, in a studious cadence. Yes Snuggle, you chirp, almost reflexively as take a deep breath, and tighten the layer of hidden muscles blanketing your womb to righteous brood in place."; 
	else:
		say "'Mh Pet is such a fine canvas,' the odd ooze snickers, caressing her free hand along the delectable curves of your digitigrade thighs, groping a goopy pawful of tender foxy floof. 'And vast too, she spoils us with possibilities.' she teases, drawing her doll's palm along your generously padded ass. Giggling at her touch, you cheekily point out that this form was her design.";
		say "     'Perhaps, but we borrowed from our precious girl's dreams,' she swoons, gently stroking your pelt while fingers sink into the lush folds of your ample tush. 'But in the end,' she beams, crimson eyes twinkling like road flares in the night, 'it was Pet who guided our paw, who gave us a purpose, who made us whole, and sheltered us from harm. For that, we will always be grateful to her, and any she holds dear.' she says, lovingly pressing her goopy snoot against your hips, chirping happily to herself as she nuzzles your luxurious fur. Delighted by her antics, you merely run your silky mitts along the top of her head, chirping your appreciation and renewed eagerness to see what further wonders she can weave.";
		WaitLineBreak;
	say "     'Thank you, now lets see where to begin.' Snuggle trills, gracefully arcing her doll's fingers along the silky edges of your [bodydesc of Player] flanks with an almost practiced flourish. Airy and light, you can barely detect even the slightest bit of pressure being applied to your pelt as she applies a foundational layer to curves. Only a slight cool, tingling numbness blossoming along your sides in the wake of her strokes alerts to any change. Intrigued, you tilt your head to once side for a better look, 'ah-ah-ah, stand still naughty Pet, guiding our doll and taming these fascinating automata takes all our concentration,' Snuggle tuts, as her amorphous true body burbles plaintively behind you. Sorry, you peep almost reflexively as you straighten your back. 'Good girl, we know you're curious, but would you kindly wait till we're done, pretty please?' she coos, her sweet sylvan echoing about like a clarion chime. Nodding, you fix your gaze on some random section of wall, allowing the ";
	if "Touched by Madness" is listed in feats of Player:
		say "artismic ooze ";
	else:
		say "artistic ooze ";
	say "to work her magic.";
	say "     Little-by-little, your chosen addition starts taking shape as the coiling chill tide of change spreads across you in a flurry of [italic type]brush[roman type] strokes flicking across your cuddly body. Despite the gels warning, you can't resist peering at her doll's arm whorling about you as it twists and bends in unnatural angles, applying touches up and detail at a pace that would break lesser beings. Yet even she appears to have her limits as the doll's face droops in places and once her willowy hips sag like rivulets of amber caught in a squall. While sections of her avatar's flanks slosh off in bubbling piles of overtaxed ooze, still her pace remains unbroken as your fur slowly begins to shift, taking on your desired changes in places. But only briefly, as they seem to hit a wall of sorts despite the goo girl's continued efforts. '*Tsk* stubborn machines, always fighting, always trying to hurt us, why won't they just yield,' Snuggle grunts, while her doll's ears bubble and flop to the sides as a nascent wave of billowing heat simmers about your core.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     'No matter, Pet is counting on us,' she whispers, as the growing warmth gripping you spreads outwards along your fecund curves. You spy paper thin wisps of odorless billowing along your joints as ribbons of the purest pearly velvet were pouring off you. Alarmed, but unwilling to interrupt the frenzied gel, you carefully glance down your changing figure and ";
	if "boring fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "smile as the excess pounds clinging to you melt away. Overjoyed, by the welcome lightness, and return to your more shapely figure, you can't help but sigh in relief as watch your tummy tighten, arms regain their definition, and shrink towards a more sensible proportion. Stars you needed this, you muse, more than a hair grateful to shed those pounds. Fun as it might be to enjoy to added bounce to your step, or smother some naughty fuck meat beneath you. Alongside the feeling of safety you sometimes while your paws across your lush cub filled gut, you still prefer a bit more tone on your curves.";
	else if "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "almost mewling in dismay as much of your voluptuous curves and hard won pudges is consumed to fuel your transformation. Already, your tainted mind reels at the unwanted sense of lightness gripping your perfectly snuggly body as your lush padding melts away. Revealing unsightly muscles and boorish sinew hidden beneath your opulent foxy padding, despite this, you can't help but mournfully run a paw across your flank as your body continues to shrink.";
	else:
		say "wistfullying watching the unsubtle alterations coursing through as the respectable stores of foxy fluff gracing your fecund flanks is burned off. Rather disinterested in the slimming of your waist, a part of you offhandly wonders what manner of nano mechanical alchemy the goopy vixen must be employing to sculpt your lush figure so. And whether your vast reserve of tainted calories is being used to bend the nanites to Snuggle's will, or if the odd ooze might be feeding off you in a round about fashion. You muse, observing the fleeting wisp of vapor off your joints and the uniform shrinkage gripping you with mild interest.";
	say "     All the while, the oblivious ooze brush flickers across your extremities, leaving a growing thermocline of numbing cold and a drain heat in their as the first true hints of change slowly flutter along your extremities. Yet still, the nanite's seem to resist Snuggle's touch as your colors mix like a tidal squall of oil and water. In places, some sections seem to unravel as your current hues try to subsume the new. Hissing at the sight, Snuggle's doll chases after each stubbornly slathering your form in ever thicker streaks of bubbling goo even as her avatar continues to decay before you, losing much of its definition. As its ears boil and muzzle droops downward like crooked, while pours more and more its attention to chasing the unwinding threads of its work. A part of you even considers calling out to her, but the steely looking in what's left of it crimson eye's stills your tongue as your gulp and straighten your back. The doll burbles something in reply but the words are lost as its features atrophy, and sizzle away to but a single malformed arm puttering about your contours at a commendable tempo.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "   Till at last, the nanites seem to give, the changes begin to stick as more and more of warring pigments settle into their desired place while the doll collapses in on itself with a tired, bubbling whimper. Worried, you begin to call out to it, begging to know if its alright, only to have the words dying on your lips as Snuggle's true body roils in the distance as a new avatar's foot paws step out of its amorphous mass. Blinking at the spectacle, you tilt your head, observing in quiet awe as its body unfurls upward like some manner of paper doll with a well-pleased chirp. 'Oh sorry did we scare you Pet?' it chuckles, strutting beside its true body, tail swishing in a mischievous tattoo. 'But our poor doll,' the ooze gestures to hissing pile of goop at your paws, 'was getting old anyways. But don't worry, we can always make more when the need arises.' she shrugs observing the last few spatters of magenta slime fizzling away.";
	Decrease Perception of Mistress Snuggle by 1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 2 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
