to say definitallynotlasic:
	say "     'Hm a most interesting request Pet, but one we are more than happy to accommodate,' Snuggle trills, with a thoughtful rap of her goopy claws along the ground. 'So tell us how may we sculpt your pretty ears? Shall we make them a widdle smaller for you and maybe add a cute patch of fuzzy-wuzzy fur on their tips?' she preens excitedly. 'Or would rather have some adorable fennec ears to keep you cool on the days. After all, we can only imagine how rough the summer months must be for big fuzzy girls like Pet. Why just thinking of our girl getting all sweaty tired in the noon day sun almost brings a tear to our eye.' she hums with soft caring cadence. 'Of course, whatever pet chooses, we can always change her back if she gets bored,' she adds with a casual shrug of her scintillating shoulders.";
	LineBreak;
	say "[bold type]How do you respond[roman type]?";
	LineBreak;
	let ear_job_Choices be a list of text;
	if Stamina of Mistress Snuggle > 1:
		add "Restore your old ears." to ear_job_Choices;
	add "Shrink your ears." to ear_job_Choices;
	add "Grow your ears." to ear_job_Choices;
	let ear_job_Choice be what the player chooses from ear_job_Choices;
	if ear_job_Choice is:
		-- "Restore your old ears.":
			say "[ihearyou]";
			now Stamina of Mistress Snuggle is 0;
		-- "Shrink your ears.":
			say "[ihearyou]";
			now Stamina of Mistress Snuggle is 1;
		-- "Grow your ears.":
			say "[ihearyou]";
			now Stamina of Mistress Snuggle is 2;

to say ihearyou:
	say "     'As you wish precious,' Snuggle coo, tightly drawing a goopy paw along her left as if she were wringing about some manner of damp cloth. Her gelatinous flesh bulges against her twisting grasp as her right mitt spirals while creases flow along her hide as she forces a dollop of syrupy slime up her wrist. Then with a rubber pop, yanks a fizzing section of gel free no larger than a Texas grapefruit free. Unbothered by its loss, the doll's breasts condense slightly as it shunts the exotic biomass about to compensate. All the while, the unusually ooze works the still bubbly ball of goo into separate masses, humming. 'Now if Pet would be so kind as to take a seat?' As her doll gestures to her true body with an airy bat of its tail. Nodding, and more then a little happy to get off your peets, you sashay over to her and plop down with content sigh.";
	say "     Stars you needed this, you titter over the rubber thump of your ample ass colliding with her supple mass. 'I'll bet, it pains us to think our Pet is wandering about, wearing out her pretty pads on that hard yucky concrete, instead of cuddling up on a nice soft bed like she deserves.' Snuggle teases as her avatar hops up behind you. 'But no matter, we know Pet is curious and would never deny her fun.' she chuckles, while the doll draws its arms about you, letting its heavy tits laze against your back. 'Now you might feel a little pinch and hear some ringing dear, but,' she simpers, lightly drawing her willowy snout along the fuzzy points of your ear, 'it will pass.' Nodding, as the airy weight of sweater puppies glide across your back, you tell the dotting goo you understand. 'Good this will be over shorty Pet,' Snuggle purrs cupping the bubbly mass of exotic ooze your ears.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     Tepid to the touch, the gel seeps though and down the spiral of your ear canal, deafening you to the world around you. Till only the soft beat of your pulse and tempered meter of your breath remains, unworried and buoyed by the strange sense of safety the goo girl's presence brings. You relax against her as your ears go cold and numb, if for the moment as the cartilage begins to throb. Though painless, you feel pressure building along your inner ear as flesh twisted beneath the budding fleshcrafter touch. Unbidden, your dominant hand momentarily moves toward your scalp as a curious facet of your mind wonders what manner of changes are occurring just beyond the edges of your vision. Before you think better of it, and close your eyes, letting your hands rest along the velvet pillow of Mistress Snuggle's amorphous body.";
	say "     Slowly, you can sense dissociative eddies pushing and pulling along your ear as your hearing returns. Though a part of you almost wishes for the blessed silence to return for just a few moments more as the wet snapping of cartilage washes, making you wince. 'D*n't w*rry Pe* al*ost d*ne,' Snuggle coos, her voice flickering a dying speaker while the change begins to arrest. Nippling your lower lip, you ask her to hurry as your head pounds and body boils with the heat of your enforced alterations. Yet only briefly, the fever passes, in its place effervescent lightness grips your body and Snuggle whispers. 'There there, it's ok Pet, you can open your eyes now,' while her tenderly cheek. Nodding, you crack open your eyes and find much your ";
	if "boring fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "delight, ";
	else if "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "dismay, ";
	else:
		say "suprise, ";
	say "you body has shed quite a bit of weight in the process, leaving with a thin, yet familiar physique.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     You muse, trepidatiously touch a paw your ears to confirm the changes and that despite the discomfort, your body seems to have adapted rather quickly. As your hearing normalizes, though a spot of tenderness along their base. Still, you'll probably need a proper mirror to appreciate them, you ruminate as you hop to your feet with Snuggle in tow. 'We trust Pet likes our work?' she simpers, through a cheshire grin as her avatar takes usual place beside her true body.";
	Decrease Perception of Mistress Snuggle by 1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 2 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 3 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
		StatChange "Charisma" by -1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 4 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Strength" by -3;
		StatChange "charisma" by -3;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 5 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
		StatChange "Charisma" by -1;
		StatChange "Dexterity" by -1;

to say hornythoughts:
	say "     '*Tee-hee* Pet has such wonderful tastes,' Snuggle coos, with an excited twitch of her doll's tail. 'So tell us beloved, what manner of horns would you best? Some big strong dreggy horns to strike fear into your prey and envy in your mates? A pair of smol slutty succubus handlebars for your toys to grab onto? Maybe a big rack of primal deer antlers to show off to your friends? Or perhaps you'd like some thick goat horns to protect Pet's precious head?' she proffers with a happy if oddly looking wink as gestures to her true body with a flick of her wrist. 'Of course, should you ever tire of them we can always remove them, we can only imagine how hard it must be for our lovely to get around in these tiny human hovels as it is. So we wouldn't blame you if their novelty wears thin.' she adds, lazily shrugging her shoulders.";
	LineBreak;
	say "     [bold type]How do you respond[roman type]?";
	LineBreak;
	let fox_speak_Choices be a list of text;
	add "Remove your horns." to fox_speak_Choices;
	add "Grow Dragon horns." to fox_speak_Choices;
	add "Sprout demonic handlebars." to fox_speak_Choices;
	add "Gain deer antlers." to fox_speak_Choices;
	add "Cultivate curly goat horns." to fox_speak_Choices;
	let fox_speak_Choice be what the player chooses from fox_speak_Choices;
	if fox_speak_Choice is:
		-- "Remove your horns.":
			say "[headon]";
			now morale of Mistress Snuggle is 0;
		-- "Grow Dragon horns.":
			say "[applydirectlytotheforehead]";
			now morale of Mistress Snuggle is 1;
		-- "Sprout demonic handlebars.":
			say "[applydirectlytotheforehead]";
			now morale of Mistress Snuggle is 2;
		-- "Gain deer antlers.":
			say "[applydirectlytotheforehead]";
			now morale of Mistress Snuggle is 3;
		-- "Cultivate curly goat horns.":
			say "[applydirectlytotheforehead]";
			now morale of Mistress Snuggle is 4;

to say headon:
	say "   'Oh is Pet getting tired of her rack already?' Snuggle snickers, her doll's lips purse into a knowing Cheshire grin. Eh, yes, you peep almost embarrassedly. Fun as they were, your horns are starting to become more of hindrance than anything else. More than once, you've almost gotten them tangled on some low hanging branches, to say nothing of the added difficulty you face in navigating doorways and tighter spaces around the city. 'Sh, don't feel glum precious, we understand this place wasn't made for big cuddly vixens like our wonderful girl,' she says, in soft, soothing cadence as her avatar sashays up to you, and gently wraps its arms about you. 'Maybe one day we'll find a place big enough for Pet and all her adorable cubs, but first let's take care of those horns for you.' Snuggle purrs, giving your fuzzy flanks a brief yet loving squeeze. 'Now, kneel.' she rumbles, her voice turning harsh and sharp like splintered obsidian as she snaps her fingers.";
	say "    Almost reflexively, you drop to the ground before her as if you were being pulled upon by unseen chains, sending a groaning shudder through the floor as your knee impacts the hard wood with a worrying thump. 'Good girl, this will only take a second,' Snuggle beams, working her left paw-hand into the okay sign and leveling it with your rack. 'You might want to close your eyes though dear,' she warns, sparing you a quick glance, before striking your horns at the base with her pointer finger. At once, your skull starts to throb as a band of tension grows about the roots of your horns, nowhere near painful, the reverberations still echo through the bone while tiny fissures form through your rack. Sparing a quick glance upward, bits of bony dust soon begin to fall upon you.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "    In no mood to harm your eyes, you hurriedly clench them shut and wince as ashen fragments of bone patter across your muzzle as the damage spreads across their length. Till with a porcelain crack that splits the air they shatter, showering the face in ashy calcium and sharp shards of bone, that soon crumble away to nothing. 'You may open your eyes now Pet,' Snuggle says, dryly, lightly brushing aside any lingering motes of errant matter from your visage while the hide seeps over the nubs of your once proud rack. Nodding, you gingerly crack an eye open and trepidatiously touch your mending flesh. Quietly marveling at how quickly your hide smooths out, before rising to your feet, murmuring thanks to the odd ooze. 'You are most welcome Pet, though we will miss your horns.' Snuggle tuts, dolling strutting back to its place beside her true body.";

to say applydirectlytotheforehead:
	say "     'As you wish precious Pet, this should be quick, now come, take a seat and let Mistress take of you,' she simpers, doll gesturing to her true body with a wave and bow. Nodding, you [if player is impreg_now]waddle[else]sashay[end if] over to her side and drape yourself across the goo's supple mass like you were preparing for a day at the spa. While her gelatinous form molds itself about you, cradling and supporting your ample figure with loving care you can't help gush over. 'Why thank you Pet, your comfort is important to us.' she preens with earnest devotion as her slips past, cheekily running it fingers through your two toned as it nestles itself behind your back. 'A word of warning dear, you may feel a bit of disorientation while we work, but we promise it will pass once we're done.' she hums, lovingly draping her avatar's arms about your shoulder, pressing the cushy pendulous swell of her immaculate I-cups along your back.";
	say "     Humming your understanding, you lean against her, relishing the supportive caress of her syrupy figure lazing against while peer upward to meet the vivid glow of her crimson orbs filtering through her exotic flesh. 'Good girl,' she beams, craning her doll's elastic neck downwards, planting a pair of silky goopy kisses along your forehead. Unnaturally cold to the touch, pin pricks of frost pierce your pelt as the gel pushes its lips against you, numbing your scalp and edges of your ears. 'Now lets see if these widdle machines will corporate,' she purrs, pulling her doll back, and leaving a twin splotches of gel upon your head. Distantly, you can almost hear a low fizzing wafting about your ears as ooze spreads outwards, into near perfection ovaloid shapes.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     Intrigued, a curious hand drifts towards your forehead, merely to be batted aside by a light tap of the doll's paw, while she teases. 'Naughty-naughty Pet, you know better than to interrupt our work.' Opps, you titter, jovivally, placing your hand at side. 'That's better, now where were we,' she says, gliding her goopy talon up your neck, while your hide tingles at touch and tail wags with excited energy. 'Ah now we see...' she mutters to herself, circling her finger about the gelatinous impression left by her kiss as the bone beneath bugles in response to her caress. Cold like you've rarely felt lances through you as your skin spits and recedes like the drawing of the tides while your skull bubbles towards the firmament. Shapeless and soft, the mass rises akin to a column of sea foam while Snuggle coos, 'there we go,' in a low triumphant whisper as she touches her syrupy paws to their roots.";
	say "     You feel your senses start to spin as the raw, nascent nerves quiver at the slightest caress like someone were winding a damp cloth about your skull then pulling uncomfortably tight. Wincing, you dig your fingers into Snuggle's true body desperately trying to block out the sudden rush of wrongness as she draws her fingers about the unformed length of your budding rack. Slowly guiding both its growth and curves upward and outwards like a practiced ceramicist as the budding weight of your latest alteration presses down upon you. Grimicing, the pounding of your skull deepens by the second as virgin veins form beneath your cuddly hide to supply the weighty adornments with fresh blood. Perhaps seeing your expression, Snuggle's true self reassuringly gropes your paws whispering, 'there-there, almost done Pet, we just need to give your body one more push,' as an almost familiar heat billows in your breast.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     In moments, velour streams of creamy white steam flare out from your joints as pillowy reserves of vulpine essence nestled within you are consumed in the forge of Mistress Snuggle's exotic fleshcrafting. As ";
	if "boring fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "pounderous pounds of pugnacious pudge fall melt ways, revealing the tasteful tapestry of fecund curves hidden beneath. ";
	else if "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "your precious pillow padding dissolving before your eyes, leaving your whimpering at the loss of your body's ripening beauty. ";
	else:
		say "our accumulated excess falls away."; 
	say "While hissing droplets of magenta slime patter across your shoulderblades, too afraid to move, you can only stare along the edges of your vision in chilling disquiet as you catch sight of the doll's lopsided form looming behind you.";
	say "     As its face and ears sag like melting wax beneath whatever strange backlash the nanites are leveling upon her avatar, to its credit, the doll never once falters in task. Pulling and twisting the effervescent bone into your desired form, even as its being collapses around it. Another time, you have voiced some measure of unease, or begged them to stop, yet the ardent red light pouring from its eyes and the reassuring touch of its true body stills your tongue. Instead, you close your eyes, trying to shut out the sense of vertigo, tension, and the wet squelching patter of slime dripping down your back while the doll crumbles above you. Yet the feeling remains, tinged with a budding sense of dispersion as the avatar's once frantic motions grow languide, till they stop and a thick rivulet of ooze cascades down your spine as the doll dissolves.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     Alarmed, you bolt upward, goo tainted with aberrant sweat pouring off you as whirl around and gasp at the sight of its eyes bobbing along the surface of Mistress Snuggle true body like some forlorn buoy cast adrift in a magenta sea. Snuggle? You worriedly peep. 'Yes Pet?' the disembodied words reply as slime rains down your diminished curves, pattering upon the floor like hail on a tin roof. Uh, are you ok? 'Of course dear, we hope we didn't frighten you.' the voice snickers, as a soupy mass of gel begins to swirl before you, somehow drawing in the errant gel. Well... you stammer, unsure how to reply while the vortex deeps and a new set of crimson orbs flutter towards its core. 'Oh Pet don't fret, our dolls exist to serve,' the voice purrs as pointed vulpine ears peek through the shimmering slime while the new avatar emerges and steps towards you. 'Besides, they did their job well,' the goo hums motioning to the now solidified horn atop your head, before taking its usual place.";
