to say andflyhigh:
	say "     'Such an ambitious Pet, wishing to soar amongst the clouds, to slip free of mortal bounds and caress the firmament.' Snuggle chuckles, touching her doll's fingers to its lips. 'Would that we could grant you this precious, but malleable as you, your form isn't strong enough to overcome gravity, yet. However, we can at least give you something to help out,' she says, her avatar's ears flurling to the side of its head. Nodding, you do your best to hide any disappointment you might be feeling, and ask what she had in mind then if true flight is, at least for now, outside of your reach. 'That depends on precious Pet's tastes, should you wish it we can fashion you a set of brilliant feathery wings for our lovely angel. Why just think how nice it would feel to cloak yourself in brilliant alabaster while you strut about the city, or wrap some cute plaything in their warm fuzzy folds during a cold night?' she beams, as the doll clasps its arms about itself in a goopy bear hug. 'Though some regal dragon wings might fit a lovely pred like you? *Tee-hee* we can scarcely imagine the look on your prey's face as you leap upon them, wings spread, fangs bared, and talons gleaming in the lights.' she swoons, eyes flaring a blood red.";
	say "     'Perhaps Pet might prefer something a bit more subtle and... mammalian like a mantle of glossy bat wings. After all, we bet, our big girl already has a hard enough time getting around this cramped city so why encumber yourself any further dear?' the doll playfully shrugs. 'Then again, if Pet seeks utility we can always fashion her a wonderful octet of tentacles to assist her. True, they may lack the aesthetics you desire, but why sully your pretty paws with manual labor when Mistress's gifts can do the work for you.' the odd ooze purrs, idly flexing its doll's arm outwards, while its fingers briefly lengthen and swirl before you eel grass caught in a tidal swell. 'And should Pet ever tire of them, it would be a trivial task to remove them for her.' she adds, fixing you with a disinterested look."; 
	LineBreak;
	say "     [bold type]How do you respond[roman type]?";
	LineBreak;
	let drakenguard_Choices be a list of text;
	if Depravity of Mistress Snuggle >= 1:
		add "Remove your wings." to drakenguard_Choices;
	add "Gain angelic feathery wings." to drakenguard_Choices;
	add "Acquire regal dragon wings." to drakenguard_Choices;
	add "Grow compact bat wings." to drakenguard_Choices;
	add "Sprout tentacles." to drakenguard_Choices;
	let drakenguard_Choice be what the player chooses from drakenguard_Choices;
	if drakenguard_Choice is:
		-- "Remove your wings.":
			say "[goplaydrakenguardandnier]";
			now depravity of Mistress Snuggle is 0;
		-- "Gain angelic feathery wings.":
			say "[ornotImnotyourmother]";
			now Depravity of Mistress Snuggle is 1;
		-- "Acquire regal dragon wings.":
			say "[ornotImnotyourmother]";
			now Depravity of Mistress Snuggle is 2;
		-- "Grow compact bat wings.":
			say "[ornotImnotyourmother]";
			now Depravity of Mistress Snuggle is 3;
		-- "Sprout tentacles.":
			say "[ornotImnotyourmother]";
			now Depravity of Mistress Snuggle is 4;

to say goplaydrakenguardandnier:
	say "     Whether out of boredom, practicality, or simple annoyance with your oft times cumbersome accents, you ask Snuggle if she could remove your wings. 'Of course dear, now turn around, let Mistress take care of those naughty wingies for you,' she hums, with a cute corkscrew of her doll's pointer finger. Nodding, you quickly turn on your heels and present your back to her. 'Alright, you might feel a bit of tingle or itch dear, but do try to stay still. We wouldn't want to sever the wrong nerve or close the wrong vein,' she says, her doll strutting up behind you with a soft clack of its goopy talons upon the floor broads. Yipping, you tell her you'll try and fix your gaze upon the windows as she runs her hands along your back mounted accents, muttering. 'Hh, the machines seem to be a little more compliant then normal, good,' while your hide bristles at her static laced.";
	say "     'All they need is a little push right,' she hesitates, gliding a claw about the connective tissue joining these unwanted limbs to your back, 'here.' she hiss, in a pleased ophidian trill, jabbing a gelatinous clawing between the fleshcrafted joints. Gasping at her touch, your flesh goes cold like ice water flowing through your veins while pins and needles courses outward about the chimeric joints. You can't help but clench your teeth as the frost nips at your cuddly and the adjoining tissue while a profound sense of dissociation billows along the edges of your mind. 'Sh, there-there Pet it will all be over soon, just hold still a moment longer,' she purrs, amid the bubbling sense of wrongness roiling within you. As the crafted nerves flail, and writhe as nanite's roughly unravel them, your wings soon go limp, hanging unnaturally low while the feeling disconnect grows by the second. Your malleable mind soon reels at their presence and you almost snarl at their weight pulling down on you as your proprioception changes.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "    It takes more than a little force of will to beat back the sudden urge to tear at the offensive limbs and rid yourself of their alien presence. Yet the words of the affectionate ooze stay your hand as your perception of them dims to the vaguest of notions, tied solely to the weight pushing down on back. 'And... there!' Snuggle crows, as the burden is lifted and a subtle sound of sands tinkling upon the hard wood greets your ears while your offending limbs dissolve behind. 'All done Pet,' she beams, reassuringly patting the now smooth patch of gracing your back. Sighing contentedly, you lean into her touch, murmuring your appreciation for her work. 'Think nothing of it sweetie, removing these was far easier then crafting them, besides the nanites did most of the work this time. Although, if Pet is feeling generous, we are getting a little peckish,' she chuckles, while the muted patter of her doll's paws echo through the loft as strides back to its usual place beside her true body.";


to say ornotImnotyourmother:
	say "     'At once my lovely foxy girl, now would you kindly?' Snuggle teases, motioning for you to turn around, and present your back to her with a playful twirl of her doll's fingers. Nodding, you do a fanciful pirouette for the doting ooze as you straighten yourself to your full milfy height. 'Splendid,' she preens pawing up behind you with a plop of her doll's gelatinous pawbs upon the hard wood as she gently traces her talons along your shoulders. Drawing a curious little yip from your lips at the probing tingle laces through your malleable hide at their touch, leaving streaks of tepid goo in their wakes. 'Hm, flesh has such intricacies compared to ourself,' she says,' drawing a claw towards your spine. 'So many little parts all speaking and competing for Pet's attention, with countless interesting preconceptions hammered into them, all of which war with the little robots in her blood, yet... we see the path of change now. Though it will not be as easy as we planned, but dread not, Mistress will take care of everything.' she coos, spaying her doll's fingers wide, while raking them back towards your shoulder blades.";
	say "     Oddly soothing, your canine side pants happily at her caress, as many a hard to reach itch is attended. 'Daw does Pet like her scratchies?' the bubbly goo giggles, lovingly works her paws through your fur, massaging an lingering tension clinging to the dense core of predatory muscles beneath. Yes ma'am, you swoon tail fluttering behind you. '*Tee-hee* Pet is so adorable, and so soft too, like a living pillow just begging for Mistress to rest her weary head on,' the goo purrs, nuzzling its cheeks against you. 'But that can wait, Pet has worked hard to earn her treat, and what kind of owner would we be if we didn't reward our special girl?' Snuggle titters, not waiting for your reply as the doll presses its talons roughly against your eager hide. You almost wince at the little pin pricks of pressure coursing through you as the seems to seep into your skin like icy vines.";
	WaitLinebreak;
	say "     Blessedly, the sensation is short lived as the nerves go quiet, leaving a patch of hoarfrost laden cold spreading towards your spine along the goopy trails left by the touch. As the roots hone in on your vulnerable vertebrae, you can't help but shuffle nervously at the intrusion, yet an unbidden calm keeps you still while the little feelers caress your senses. 'Sh, be still dear, we are not as skilled as the machines in your blood, but we promise we will make these changes feel better than they ever could.' she hums, in a comforting, eager trill as her tendrils burrow into the living lattice of your spine, flooding your milfy figure with a syrupy rush of exotic gel. Though utterly alien, her touch and the boundless ardor of her voice is positively infectious as a feeling of giddy anticipation surges through you while the creeping feelers filtering up your back. In moments, your skull tingles with the first flickering caress of her tendrils boring into your brain.";
	say "    'There we go, a nice little bit of happy chemicals should make this go all the quicker dear,' Snuggle purrs, as a dopey smile blossoms your lips. He-he feels... good, you babble, as bubbly almost alcoholic warmth floods, making giggle at sight of the trails dance across the wood work. 'That's right sweetie, just relax and let all those mean old worries go,' she coos, amid a renewed up well of heat and effervescent pressure coiling along your shoulderblades. Nodding, your eyes remain locked on the strange veiny pulses dancing across the timbers in a hypnotic meter. Watching them dance, a waning analytical side of you detects the nascent hints of impending transformation billowing across your flesh as the ooze pours itself into you. Oddly though, somehow this feels different, and almost right to you as your hide flares outward and fur shifts towards your desired state.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "      Distantly, a part of you wonders how much of this psychosomatic, nanite born, or conjured by the goopy vixen's influence as vague rumors of the nanite's ability to rewrite one's sense of self to accept their changes swirl with your own first hand memories. Perhaps it is all of these things, you muse, observing brilliant impossible hues waltz about the edges of your vision. Regardless, as your flesh is stretched outward and new joints and chimeric roil into being, you can't help but bask in the changes. Your unfinished 'wings' twitch behind you with an air of impossible familiarity as you were born with them. Gone is the sense of dissociation you sometimes felt during more banal alterations, their every flutter is almost nostalgic and invigorating, like a limb awakening. Even their weight feels uncannily welcome as your sense of self is seamlessly rewoven to accommodate the change. Gods this feels amazing, you moan, tongue lolling from lips as your chem-addled mind drinks your Mistress's touch. 'Oh course it does Pet, crafty as the nanites may be, they are crude in their approach and don't appreciate the bountiful clay they've been given.' the goopy fox simpers, masterfully working it paws along the numbed contours of your morphic hide.";
	say "      All the while, wafer thing bands of pearly alabaster steam begin to puddle about your joints as the hardy stores of nanite tainted calories gracing your cuddly body are consumed to fuel the changes rippling through you. Too drugged to care, your gaze simply dances between each motes as the image coils and ruffles along enthralling vertices as your body tightens, then shrinks by seconds. You can barely even hear, must less parse the soft little hum and ambient gurgles of the doll behind you as changes near their apex. Beastly strength and purpose flood the goop smattered limbs while the raw, chaotic hide swaddling starts to settle into place. 'There. It. Is. Doonnneee *[bold type]plop[roman type]*,' Snuggle sighs, hands falling from your back while an audible wet thump echoing from behind you as a rush of vicious gel cascades about your peets.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     Bereft of her doll's touch, your vision snaps about into place and clarity returns to your mind as hastily do an about face to peer down at the puddle of gel fizzing away beneath. S-sn-snuggle? You peep, eyes going wide at the sight of her doll's apparent demise. 'Yes Pet,' the girl's true body burbles, as a fresh set of crimson eyes lazily float to the top of its amorphous mass upon odd eddies of gelatinous form. Uh are you ok? 'Oh course, though our poor dolly seems to have sprung a leak,' her voice titters, while ruby-like eyes turn towards you. 'No matter, our avatars are like grains of wheat, so don't shed a tear over their loss,' the voice says, goopy foot-paws pop out of gel's sides as a new fresh faced doll emerges. 'See, no harm done, so long as a single cell remains we can regenerate, in time.' the avatar shrugs, marching to its usual place beside her true body.";
	Decrease Perception of Mistress Snuggle by 1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 2 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 3 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
		StatChange "Charisma" by -1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 4 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Strength" by -3;
		StatChange "charisma" by -3;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 5 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
		StatChange "Charisma" by -1;
		StatChange "Dexterity" by -1;


To say letsberealyourgonnaskforninetails:
	say "     'Ah we had assumed Pet would ask this of us sooner or later,' Snuggle simpers, knowingly as her doll's tail bods behind it. 'Trifling task as it may be, you should know dear we can only divide your tail eight times. Though from what we have gleaned from your memoirs, your former kin placed a special,' she hesitates, while the doll idly taps its chin, 'importance on two and nine tailed vixens. Regardless, Pet can have up to nine and no more, of course should you wish it, we can always remove or add more overtime. Well, so long as our lovely girl has been keeping herself fed. After all you wouldn't want to ruin that sexy figure of yours dear,' she preens, lips curling into a lewd little grin as her avatar admires your luscious proportions. Blushing, you can't help but lean into her gaze, briefly wallowing in the attention paid to you as invitingly fluff your fur and murmur your agreement. '*Tee-hee* cheeky Pet, now speak your desires, and Mistress will make them so.'";
	LineBreak;
	say "     [italic type]How many tails do you ask for[roman type]?";
	LineBreak;
	let where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices be a list of text;
	if Charisma of Mistress Snuggle >= 1:
		add "Go back to a single tail." to where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	add "Dyad." to where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	add "Triumvirate." to where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	add "Quartet." to where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	add "Quintet." to where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	add "Sextet." to where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	add "Septet." to where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	add "Octet." to where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	add "Nonet." to where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	let where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choice be what the player chooses from where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choices;
	if where_is_my_damn_tail_Bruce_Choice is:
		-- "Go back to a single tail.":
			say "[notasonicOC]";
			now Charisma of Mistress Snuggle is 0;
		-- "Dyad.":
			say "[therenameistailswithaz]";
			now Charisma of Mistress Snuggle is 1;
		-- "Triumvirate.":
			say "[therenameistailswithaz]";
			now Charisma of Mistress Snuggle is 2;
		-- "Quartet.":
			say "[therenameistailswithaz]";
			now Charisma of Mistress Snuggle is 3;
		-- "Quintet.":
			say "[therenameistailswithaz]";
			now Charisma of Mistress Snuggle is 4;
		-- "Sextet.":
			say "[therenameistailswithaz]";
			now Charisma of Mistress Snuggle is 5;
		-- "Septet.":
			say "[therenameistailswithaz]";
			now Charisma of Mistress Snuggle is 6;
		-- "Octet.":
			say "[therenameistailswithaz]";
			now Charisma of Mistress Snuggle is 7;
		-- "Nonet.":
			say "[therenameistailswithaz]";
			now Charisma of Mistress Snuggle is 8;


to say notasonicOC:
	say "     'A trifling task my sweet foxy pet,' Snuggle hums, it's a doll shrugging beside her true body, before pawing it up to you with lazy gait. 'Now, just hand us your tails and we'll meld them back together for you.' she says, as the doll extends its hand to you. Nodding, you turn on the balls of your supple pad and curl your extraneous limbs into a single fluffy mass, before plopping them into the doll's waiting mitts. 'Thank you Pet, though we must say,' the goo pauses, running the goopy constructs fingers through the borders of your fur, 'we will miss these, but your happiness always comes first dear.' she simpers, smearing a thin line of vibrant magenta slim through the little cracks in your entwined tail. Though light at first, as the layers deepen seep past your velvety fur a cooling numbness begins to filter across your hide. As the nibbling chill creeps to your tail bone, your sensation starts to ebb while the hackles on your collar raise in quiet alarm at the growing cocoon of gel tightening about tails.";
	say "     Dimly, you can almost see the flesh fusing beneath the effervescent slime as the ooze pours between the shrinking gaps and bounding with your body. In moments, the border starts to vanish, as your flesh knits and fur tights in places forming a single congerous, if bulbous mass. Almost comically swollen like some manner of living balloon animal, the liminal limb refuses even the slightest of commands as the doll tightens its grip upon the changing tissue. To your far traveled eye, her strokes remind you of a potter as they spiral about your tail, coaxing it to a finer taper. Little-by-little, the shape returns as the goop recedes, likely absorbed by the morphic tissue as the exotic bones blend together, reforming into a more banal structure you are accustomed to. Observing its refinement with a detached clinical, you sense feeling start to flicker through its base as its goopy vanishes.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     Still raw from the changes, a brief feeling of disconnect swirls through as the altered nerves fire and sinew roils at the fledgling caress of your trickling through it. Perhaps sensing this, the goopy fox doll fixes you with a reassuring looking, saying. 'Don't worry Pet, we're just smooth a few rough patches of stubborn nerves, wouldn't want to give you any phantom limbs now would we?' in a soft comforting tone as the dolls fingers twirl about the lingering patch of slime in a chaotic waltz. Frictive and maddening to behold, the inhuman movements of its digits would make a lesser woman reel, yet a curious side of you still watches with rapt intent as hide writhe in tune with her movements. All the while, your bodily sense of self normalizes and tenderness leaves you, till the goopy vixen releases her hold, crying triumphantly. 'All done Pet! Give her a test and let Mistress know if everything works' as it doll motions for your turn about.";
	say "     Bobbing your head, you do a quick spin and carefully flex the restored limb before letting it rest behind you, telling her your tail appears to be in order. 'Good, the flesh is still,' the doll grimaces, 'foreign to us. So immutable parts all talking at once, so pieces to balance, and a single discordant note left unchecked could spell doom for our girl.' she sighs, as the doll shakes its head. 'How the machines in your blood are able to rewrite you so vexes us to no end. Still, they serves their purpose and bring Pet such joy,' she mutters, more to herself than you as the doll strides to over to it usual place without another word.";

to say therenameistailswithaz:
	say "     'At once precious Pet,' the doll nods, motioning for you to present your tail to it with a gentle wave of its goopy paw. Shrugging, you strut toward with a happy waggle of your hips as you flex your tail before yourself and lightly plop it in the doll's waiting palm. 'Good girl, we warn you though, these changes are a touch,' the avatars goopy ears, twitch, 'invasive so do try to stay still. After all, we can't have Pet wandering around with a limp tail now can we?' she purrs, while the doll affectionately strokes through your silk fur. Giggling at the coiling caress of its gelatinous talons brushing your hide, you give them a quick thumbs up, telling her you'll try. 'That's all we ask dear,' she says, while the doll turns its gaze toward the tail. 'Let see where to begin,' she whispers, her avatar's eyes flashing a brilliant crimson. 'Ah a little branch here,' Snuggle coos, tracing a talon across the small of your back. 'A few divisions there,' they murmur, drawing a claw about the length of your tail."; 
	say "     'And just a touch of essence from Pet,' they coo, cheekily groping a lewd pawful of your lovely foxy fluff, 'should be all we need.' The goopy girl proudly preens, its doll's finger tips sag ever-so-slighty, growing fat and vicious as shimmering droplets of magenta gel along their edges. Curious, but in no mood to interrupt her, you merely watch as she inscribes a series of lines upon your rear mounted limb. Light and airy, you would have barely even noticed her touch were it not the budding chill imparted by the ooze as it seeps through pelt like tepid honey. 'And now for the fun part,' she hums, clasping the doll's mitts to the edges of your limb. 'Brace yourself dear, you may feel a sudden draft,' Snuggle snickers, as her avatar tugs on. Your follicles cry in alarm as your elastic hide is pulled taut, and whimper mewl peters from your lip as cracks form along the goopy trails drawn upon your tail.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "      Steeling yourself, you try to suppress the rug to pull away from her while your eyes widen in alarm at the otherworldly sight of your splitting along these ad hoc seams. Though painless, the spectacle of the magenta scab running along the length of each section is... disquieting. You muse, hackles bristling at the unbidden kiss of the air wafting about your segmented tails while the gooey doll gently drapes the limb appendages over one of her arms. 'Such feisty nerves already crying out of direction,' she hisses, in a soft ophidian trill, touching a hand to your spine. '*Tee-hee* there-there Mistress will give you noisy cells purpose,' she adds, as sudden static jolt leaps through you. Far from painful, the accompanying hits you like a rush of molten caffeine as your body grows hot to the touch and odorless plumes of milky white billow from your joints.";
	say "      Duly intrigued, you turn your gaze towards your dominant arm and watch in ";
	if "boring fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "sublime elation as adipose excess clinging to your curves starts to ebb as the otherworldly influence of the doting ooze makes itself known. Already, you can feel your body growing lighter by second as the pounds melt off your sensual form, revealing the comely foxy figure beneath. A part of you can't help but internal cheer and urge the goopy vixen on in base desperation to free yourself of your excessive padding. ";
	else if "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		say "abysmal dismay as your precious padding is consumed to fuel your changes. True, on some level, you acknowledge the grim necessity, but you still feel almost... naked without your plush protective curves swaddling you. To say nothing of the budding ire you feel nipping at the edges of your mind as you catch sight of the gross, mannish muscles peeking out from along your thighs and upper arm. Much sad state of your opulent belly, as the poor thing practically wastes a way to fuel your changes. Tutting under your breath, you lovingly tussling your tummy, promising your hard working stomach [if player is impreg_now]and precious kits[end if] you'll find plenty of yummy prey once Snuggle is done. ";
	else:
		say "pure analytical curiosity as your body's stored excess is methodically consumed by the gel's influence. While some part of you can't help but wonder how she's able to safely target each pocket of adipose so... cleanly. After all, your body has all manner of fatty tissue used to cushion your heart and organs that she could accidentally tap. You ruminate, observing the oddly dissolution of tallow clinging to your upper arms. To your neutral eyes, your hide almost seems like it were being sculpted as your muscles practically [italic type]pop[roman type] into place with an unnatural ease. ";
	say "All the while, the doll's attention remains fixed on your shifting limbs poly-sected sections as boiling torrent of goo bound changed billows along the small of your back as the base of swells like a furry balloon.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "    Deadened as it is, your tainted senses hardly registers the visible inflammation as even being part of you, yet such idle thoughts leave you as roiling potential surges outward along split fragments of your tail. Unnerved and intrigued in equal measure, your eyes start to widen at the sight of them flaring outward as the amorphous biomass settles into its new place. Though malformed and chaotic, you can just barely see hits of bone and sinew rifling along the gelatinous membrane coating, but only briefly. As the barrier starts to meld with your flesh, forming new skin and fur as the ooze recedes in fizzing flurry till your hide is seamlessly knit shut. Yet the numbness remains as the unfinished nerves resist your simplest of commands, perhaps sensing this, Snuggle lets out a reassuring tut. 'Nearly done dear, just need to stitch these tender nerves.' as she gently caresses the small of your back. 'Sh quiet now little cells, your voices are making it hard to,' *glop* the ooze pauses as a goopy magenta ear falls from her avatar's head. 'Keep our doll together,' she sighs, seemingly unbothered by the spectacle.";
	say "     'Oh no matter, this one was getting old anyway,' the doll shrugs, it's face dripping like melting wax as it works its talons along your back in a maddening scrawl, leaving thin streaks of effervescent slime in their wake. Though short lived, with each fizzling stroke the feeling returns to tail... no tails you correct yourself. As the first blessed twitch of your expansive limbs tickles the back of your mind, more than used to such changes, you expect a few moments of awkwardness during these initial seconds. Yet, their movement feel natural to you, like a limb awakening from a long sleep, as your proprioception effortlessly adjusts to their presence. Even your balance seem to have improved as the altered weight pulls your posture just a bit straighter, you ruminate curling their tips in simple minded amazement.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     '*Tee-hee* does Pet approve of our work,' she trills. Shaking your head at the sound of her voice, you turn your attention back to her lopsided doll and almost hiss at the sight of its decay. As its jowls sag before you like some gelatinous blood hound's lips, while one of its eyes slowly rolls out of its socket and shatters upon the floor into a plume of ruby dust. Gulping, you tell her very much. 'Good... we... are... happy to,' *[italic type]schlorp[roman type]* the goo's voice trails off as the doll falls backwards, and dissolves into an odorless cloud at your feet the moment its body hits the ground. Flummoxed, you feel a worrying cry building inside you, only for the words to fizzle on your lips as watery churning from her true body draws your eye to the back of the room. As the morphic goo parts along its center, a new doll's foot-paw burst from its core, rising like a puppet on invisible strings murmuring, 'help our precious girl.' as it straightens out and takes in proper place beside its main form with expectant look in its shimmering ruby eyes.";
	Decrease Perception of Mistress Snuggle by 1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 2 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 3 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
		StatChange "Charisma" by -1;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 4 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Strength" by -3;
		StatChange "charisma" by -3;
	if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 5 and "best fox" is listed in Traits of Player:
		StatChange "Stamina" by -1;
		StatChange "Strength" by -1;
		StatChange "Charisma" by -1;
		StatChange "Dexterity" by -1;

the fuckscene of Mistress Snuggle is "[Snugglefuck]".

to say Snugglefuck:
	say "     [italic type]Mistress Snuggle's lewd are temporary disabled due to time constants, but will be added in a future update.[roman type]";

Table of Game Objects (continued)
name	desc	weight	object
"Fox Suit"	"Profoundly light despite its size and supremely cuddly nature, this highly elastic vulpine fursuit might have cost someone a pretty penny, at least in the days before it was possible to become a fox. Now though, the thing is little more than an idle curiosity of a bygone age, with little obvious use beyond serving as insulation during a cold evening, or perhaps blocking the odd punch from a weaker feral. Despite this, it's hard not to admire the silky texture of orange fur covering much of its surface, or the subtle opalescent quality of the creamy white splotch running down its core and inner thighs. Much less the dense layer of snuggly softness coating it, along with the oddly realistic quality of the faux digitigrade legs, plush bubble butt, and the cute girly bend of its arms. Hidden beneath a thick layer of downy smooth fur along its groin though, is a convenient little pink latex slit permitting ease of access to your more *ahem* [italic type]sensitive areas[roman type] when the need arises."	2	Fox Suit

Fox Suit is a grab object.
Fox Suit is equipment.
It is not temporary.
Plural of Fox Suit is true.
Taur-compatible of Fox Suit is false.
Size of Fox Suit is 0.
AC of Fox Suit is 15.
Effectiveness of Fox Suit is 80.
