Slot of Fox Suit is "crotch".
Scent of Fox Suit is "Oddly crisp and clean despite your highly limited hygiene options, your vulpine costume gives off a subtle scent of crisp pine and earthy tangs.".
EquipFunction of Fox Suit is "[EquipFoxSuit]".
UnequipFunction of Fox Suit is "[UnequipFoxsuit]".
to say UnEquipFoxSuit:
	say "";
to say EquipFoxSuit:
	if HP of Mistress Snuggle >= 98:
		say "     Zipping up your heavily-padded prize with expectant hum, you feel your lips curling into a simple-minded grin as the lingering taint of this strange apparel sinks into your respective being. Visible goosebumps suddenly flicker across your hide in a sudden tide of welcome changes as your old comfortable pelt washes you, blanketing your eager form in plush downy softness that seems to pool around your groin. Oddly invigorating, the squall of transformative energies quickly leaves you panting like a needy bitch in heat as your sex shift into a more fruitful vulpine form befitting your increasingly foxy sensibilities.";
		infect "Snuggle Fox";
		infect "Snuggle Fox";
	else:
		say "";


