"Cute Tail"	"A simple cute reddish-orange foxy tail graced with a shiny white tip, and a thin elastic wrap around band on its base. Easily long enough to drag on the floor, the thing is kept slightly curled by some clever sowing and seems to sway in tune with your every step. Despite its quality, it's little more than a novelty in this day and age, yet a part of you often feels compelled to wear it regardless in the hopes you might one day grow such a lovely vulpine limb."	1	Cute Tail

