to say UnequipVulpineMask:
	say "     Pulling your head out of the sometimes stuffy mask, you take a moment to breathe a small sigh of relief as a welcome breeze wafts across your face. For the comfort your costume offers, the restricted vision and the occasional smell of your post-apocalyptic breath can be a touch... unpleasant. You chuff, stashing away your unique find.";
	increase Humanity of Player by 1; [IDK if this is even needed. I just added this on a whim.]

to say EquipVulpineMask:
	say "     Straightening the eye whole of your mask into place, the fabric around you seems to hum with a near mechanical whorl as latent nanites saturating its surface seeps into your skull. Far from uncomfortable, a cooling numbness creeps over you as your face is pulled, and reshaped beneath its fluffy exterior into a proper vulpine visage.";
	Infect "Snuggle Fox";



