"Latex Fishnet Lingerie"	"A phenomenally flexible set of regal purple lingerie born from the unusual creatures dwelling with your former fursuit, this latest addition to your post-apocalyptic wardrobe seems able to stretch or shrink to fit your malleable body. Though the dormant nanites enameled to it seems hellbent on transforming you into a milfy fox. Not that you mind, the fetching magenta apparel's stockings and gloves highlights your vulpine natural curves better than anything. More than once, you've caught yourself admiring the way the anomalous latex seems to hug your paws, or fluffs your chest. To say nothing of the wonderful support it gives to your baby bump are second to none while still advertising your sex to all comers."	1	Latex Fishnet Lingerie

