to say moreyiff:
	if Player is impreg_now and bodyname of Player is "Snuggle Fox" and Player is Pure and "Vore Predator" is listed in Feats of Player and "UB Pred" is listed in Feats of Player:
		say "     Running your fingers along the smooth latex-like contours of your Lacy Choker, you decide to try your paws at fitting the thing once more. True, you have no idea what will happen if you do, but a mix of spiteful curiosity and a distant sense of obligation to the strange creature that gifted you, and you pause, a hand drifting to the lovely swell of your pillowy belly. Your sweet [italic type]widdle[roman type] kits this adorable milfy body edges you on. After all, they did such a good job with you so far it would be a shame to let their work go unfinished. You snicker, drawing your mitt along the silky curves of your adorable fluffy tummy fur, relishing the sublime softness of your fur and the brilliant spark of your cream white pelt as your fingers are swallowed by the comforting layer of downy pudge swaddling your kits. Grinning at the sight of your digits sinking into your cushy pelt, a feeling of calm and safety washes over you as your playful trace a finger along your puffy navel. Your kits shuffle within their opulent home as a soft hungry rumble from deep ripples in the pit of your belly.";
		say "     Guess you girls are getting peckish too, don't worry, mommy will get us all someone to eat real soon. But for now, you need to let her tinker with this, ok? You purr in a gentle melodious tenor as you tap one of their tiny toes with your claw. A happily flutter of activity flickers along your opulent womb as brood wriggle excitedly before settling against your downy pads. Daw such good little hunters, you're going to make your mother so proud one day, now let's see if you can get this on. You hum, giving your ample middle one last affectionate rub. A part of you can only imagine what more they had in store for your and your [italic type]snuggly[roman type] cubs. True, you're no stranger to transformation at this point, but something about this form is different, almost natural to you, you muse. Already, you feel stronger than ever, you beam, letting a paw slowly glide down your thunderous digitigrade thighs, delighting in the sense of power coiling in their dense muscles.";
		WaitLineBreak;
		say "     Not to mention sexier too, you crow, gazing down at your [breast size desc of Player] tits lazing upon your oh-so-ripe womb like it was their own personal throne. While your orange and white fur shimmers in the light as if it were spun from mercurial twilight and lustrous pearl. To say nothing of your adorable pawbs, much less the divinely smooth beans decorating your onyx mitts, impossibly supple, at times it almost feels shameful to walk upon them like some common feral. Some facet of your predatory mind quips as you tilt your head to gaze at the well-cushioned curves of your ample ass. Sure, there might have been a time when the sight of your thong busting cheeks and adorable muffin top would have grated you, but your voluptuous build has grown on you. Now, the added pounds only make your milk all the sweeter, and keeps your precious bump safe, you swoon. So who knows what else your old hangers-on had in store for had they had more time to refine your foxy body. You preen, clasping your choker to your neck and slowly bring the end together.";
		say "     To your amazement, the sections fit cleanly as a soft, oddly enticing click rings in your foxy ears, followed by a low hiss a kin to someone popping the cork on a wine bottle as something warm and... wet pours out of the tiny cracks in the otherwise wafer thin mechanism. Though a warning trickle of alarm nips at the back of your mind as whatever this vicious tepid material is puddles down the small of your back. The feeling is unusually short lived as the goopy strands splinter and warp about your cushy body, caresses and stroking your cuddly curves with a familiar tempo that puts you at ease. Casting your gaze behind you, your eyes go wide with a curious satisfaction at the sight of the metallic magenta flowing down your legs, and puddling around your paws. Holy crap they're back! You cheer, tail wagging with an eager energy at the thought your dotting acquaintances have reconstituted in this new goopy body. How or why, you can't be certain, nor do you particularly care as you though your parting was a sour one, a part of you is overjoyed to show off your fecund foxy form to them.";
		WaitLineBreak;
		say "      Mute as ever, the former feelers offer little in the way of reply as more of their morphic mass creeps over you, playfully petting your regal fur, or lapping at your toes like a subdued, balmy tropical wave. Guess you guys like how everything turned out, you smicker, cupping your paws over their inquisitive gossamer mass. 'Well of course we are Pet, you've made your mistress very happy.' A velvety, feminine voice whispers in your left ear, as the ooze pooling along your lovely paunch condolences into two distinct 'tubes' beneath your arms. Hackles rising, you look back and almost gasp at the sight of a quasi-formed canine head no larger than a man's fist with ruby red eyes staring back at you. Letting your gaze wander the unusually goo's unfinished visage, your far-traveled can just barely make some familiar vulpine features on its sharpening ears and slender muzzle, as it molds itself before you. In moments, cute little whiskers form on the sides of its snout, while it seeps out of the locket and curls around yours like some manner of oily serpent. 'Sh don't be scared sweetie, we know this must be quite the shock but you know, we, I, us, Snuggle would never hurt you.' the growing gooey vulpine visage hums in a comforting tone as crude gelatinous fingers form under yours. Though its mouth never once moves, the words and their tranquil tone still dance through the air with the same sublime clarity as regular speech.";
		say "   Snuggle? You query, nervously flickering your ears as more of the doughy ooze pools around your paws. 'Yes pet, and it's so nice to truly meet you after all you've done for us.' The gooey fox beams, its faux-lips curling into a proud grin as its jello-like body continues to solidify behind you. Already, you can feel a dainty hourglass torso pressing against your plush back, while a single pillar of effulgent goo grips your legs with a profound, yet gentle strength. 'Why,' the magenta vixen coos, giving your cuddly body a loving hug, 'if it weren't for you, we'd be sitting in those musty old boxes, or gotten torn up by some naughty husky.' she teases, pulling your paws into the waiting embrace of her jello-like body. 'But now we can finally reward our big cuddly girl, and her sweet babes like they deserve. With us here, you won't need to think, struggle, or worry about all those mean old human problems ever again. You can sit back,' she whispers into your ear as you sink into her evergrowing body as if it were your own personal water bed, 'and let us take care of you like a good girl deserves.' she chuckles, torse glides across blissfully warm body while your drawn into a luxurious recline.";
		WaitLineBreak;
		say "     In spite of a brief flash of suspicion arching through your mind, the feeling of blissful weightlessness cascading over your plush matronly body still such notions as you thoughtlessly relax into her embrace. Mh, that does sound kind of nice, you murmur, dreamily gazing at your opulent body floating in a veritable ocean of welcoming gel as its unseen currents caress and pamper your paws. 'We would hope, but you still need a little more work before you're truely ready embrace the real you.' she teases, as she looms over you and cups her slender mitts to muzzle, playfully chin and whiskers. Work? You hum, as the subtle hypnotic glow of her eyes seems to bore into you. 'Yes, we can still see all those mean, nasty, human thoughts and attachment holding our Pet back from being the good girl she was always meant to be.' Snuggle titters, tracing a sleek finger along your collar's tag. 'And what's more this big, fluffy body hasn't even reached its potential,' she hums, drawing her goopy paws along the generous bight of your [breast size desc of Player] breasts. 'But don't worry your mistress is here to help you bloom and channel all that lovely potential.' she say, groping a pawful of fecund foxy flesh.";
		say "     Nodding, you ask her to explain what manner of potential she's referring to. 'Oh just the best kind in the world dear, the potential to change not just yourself, but all those silly broken foxes wandering the city into cute obedient widdle daughters and playmates. Or,' she rumbles, while her mitts drift down to your regal bump, 'some padding for this big sexy body.' Blushing, you try to look away from the sultry vixen, muttering you don't know what she's talking about. '*Tee-hee* there's no need to be shy, we know all your naughty secrets, and... appetites,' she crows, lips curling back into a knowing wolfish. 'So don't be ashamed, we know the hunger swirling within you, how you look at all the yummy monsters infesting this place and wonder how they taste, or if they'd make pretty daughters.' she swoons, leaning over your bountiful body and plants the lightest of kisses upon your lips.";       
		WaitLineBreak;
		say "     Stammering, you shake your head bleating out some half-hearted denials, while Snuggle looks up at you with a cheeky, amused grin, before you let out a sigh, and admitting to some of your more exotic urges. 'See, doesn't it feel good to be honest with yourself, after all what's there to be ashamed of?' she asks, while the ooze coiling about you goes strangely calm. Gulping, you list off a myriad of reasons, how you fear being rejected by the old world, having others turn their backs on you, or the looks of disgust your appetites would earn you. 'Daw poor Pet, you shouldn't worry about that, this is the one place in the world you can finally be yourself. Besides, you know that's just the silly human part of you talking. With our help you get rid of those troublesome memories and boring thoughts so you can focus on being the biggest, bestest mommy pred ever! So what do you say, will you let us change you?' she preens, looking at you for a replay. [bold type]How do you respond, tell her you're not her pet, or agree to let her continue changing you[roman type]?";
		LineBreak;
		say "     [italic type]Author's note: Choosing: 'Not her pet' will not lock you out of Mistress Snuggle's content, yet, but will prevent you from using your infections special features till you accept her offer. Additionally, the following story includes but is not limited the following kinks: F/M, H/M, F/F, F/H, Soft vore, pet play, paw worship, lactation, breeding, alt preg, PC CTFing specific ferals, MtI, FtI, human to anthro TF's, body worship, belly worship, semi-optional Player WG, UB, and lite subby content. If this is not to your taste, a lesser version the Snuggle Fox's TF can still be acquired by refusing to merge with your fursuit, but future support will be limited at best[roman type].";
		LineBreak;
		let Get_foxy_Choices be a list of text;
		add "Not her Pet." to Get_foxy_Choices;
		add "Agree to let her keep changing you?" to Get_foxy_Choices;
		let Get_foxy_Choice be what the player chooses from Get_foxy_Choices;
		if Get_foxy_Choice is:
			-- "Not her Pet.":
				say "     Shaking your head to clear it, you hurriedly hoop out of the clingy creature's embrace, snarling how you're no one's pet or property. Nor will you let yourself be taken in by some random goo peppering you with honeyed words and vague promises. 'Oh such a feisty girl, though your collar says otherwise,' she crows, gesturing to your neck with a soft flick of goopy wrist. Enraged, you tear the offending thing from your neck, then hurl it to the ground with a heavy thud as earth deforms about it, shouting your claim once more that you've heard better pitches from the ferals. 'Temper, temper, you shouldn't exert yourself in your condition,' the annoying slime tuts, crimson eyes wandering about the ample swell of your creamy middle.  'But if that is what you wish dear, we won't bother you any further. Though,' she adds with a lecherous smirk, 'if ever grow tired of struggling on your own, or wish to reconsider our offer and see what wonders we can bestow, seek us out on [bold type]Main & 7th street[roman type].";
				say "     Curious but unmoved, you curtly ask her to elaborate in a harsh warning hiss. 'Simple sweetie, merely call out our name, and we will come and sweep you off your feet like pretty vixen deservers,' it answers with an amused trills, lips peeling back into a toothless grim. And if you have no desire to see... it again, you bark, arms cross in defiance of its strange offers. 'Then we wish well, and hope wherever you go you find all the love and happiness in the world. Till then,' the creature leans, pressing its fingers to its goopy as it blows you kiss, 'Bye-bye,' it trills, slithering towards a subtle rent in the earth and slips between the gaps with a wet, meaty squelch accompanied by a light metallic rattle as vanishes beneath the cold, broken ground. Good riddance, you mumble, turning your back on whatever strange beast you unleashed. Still as you amble off in search of convenient outlet for your frustrations, and budding hunger, as part you wonders if you should have seek them out for curiosity's sake.";
				ItemLoss Unlatchable Lacy Choker by 1;
				now Second Chance is active;
			-- "Agree to let her keep changing you?":
				say "    Nodding, you tell her do have to admit it would be nice to drop the mask, and you are a touch curious about this form's full potential. After all, you can't say you aren't a fan of her work, you purr, dreamily flexing an arm before you, letting your vulpine eyes wander along the borders of your fur. This said, you add with an annoyed canine growl, you're unsure about whether you want to become hers, or anyone else's 'pet' anytime soon. 'That's alright [name of Player], we would never force our girl to do anything, but give it some time and you'll see how nice it can be to have someone take care of you like a nice spoiled vixen deserves.' Snuggle coos, as her goopy body gently traces the plush silky folds of your ebon muff. Shivering at her touch and the memory of your prior romps, you inform her that sounds more than agreeable. 'I thought you might say that, now come along, let's go somewhere quiet where I can show you how to make full use out of this big beautiful body.' she hums, motioning towards Northwest 7th Street with a flick of her ears and bat of her eyes. Shrugging, you decide to play along, and make ready to rise, only to have your goopy bed tight about your paws as Snuggle titters. 'Oh silly fox, you don't need to walk now that mistress is here to carry you.' while her torso nestles up beside you. 'I mean what kind of owner would I be if I let my sweet girl muddy her pretty paws,' she teases as silky body caresses your ankles.";
				say "    Well if she says so, and you did carry her for quite a while, so you guess it's only fair she does the same. You mew, sinking back into her supportive gelatinous body with a happy yip. 'That's the sprite dear,' she beams, body quivering beneath like a living massage chair as she sloshes forward at leisurely pace. With nothing else to do but enjoy the 'ride', you let yourself sink deeper into her luxurious embrace, thanking the doting goo girl for her hospitality and the chance to kick up your paws. 'Think nothing of it dear, you worked so hard to provide for us, and your sweet kits here,' she purrs, as her form's internal current caresses your opulent belly fur, 'now it's your turn to be fawned over.' In no mood to disagree, you simply close your eyes while Snuggle gushes over you gorgeous body, diligently petting your fur, and lavishing you with loving praise on your way to this [italic type]Quiet place[roman type] she mentioned.";
				WaitLineBreak;
				say "[Ihopethisloopworks]";
	else:
		say "    On a lark, you once more whip out your cute little choker and try to fit the thing around your neck, while the elastic material seems to conform to your neck easily enough. The lock itself vexes you to no end as mechanisms refuse to engage, or simply seem not fit to fit together almost like the internals were mismatched. Even with some modest application of brute force to the parts bears little fruit as no matter how much you twist, bend, and straighten its components, the thing always seems to snap out of alignment the moment your hand leaves its surface. Then falls to the ground with a modest clang that belies its airy heft, huffing after several more unsuccessful attempts you eventually give up then put your uncooperative trophy away. Tutting, you wonder what could be the cause, as the fishnets left behind by your old suit have been rather... accommodating. Perhaps then, the issue lies with you instead?";
		say "     After all, a fanciful side of you muses, the suit seemed to have been trying to turn you into a simulacrum of itself, or rather the character it's based on. If so, you might need to become more like this Snuggle, as one of the invoices dubbed them. True, you very much doubt you could learn to planestride, master real magic, or figure out how to absorb people anytime soon. Yet maybe if you were of a more voracious mindset and pumped full of adorable cubs like a good [italic type]cuddly[roman type] mommy fox should be, you ruminate, giving your tummy a loving pat. The chokers might stop resisting you and finally let you put it on, but you titter shaking your head, that would be insane. As though your trophy is deeply impregnated with the nanite's influence, such notions run counter to just about everything you've seen.";
		WaitLineBreak;
		say "     As the nanites seem more than willing and able to infect anyone, or thing exposed to them, to think that your choker would be actively trying to seek a 'proper' host boggles the mind. Or what's left of it, you sigh, ruefully clicking your tongue unsure what to make of the situation. For now, you'll hang on this thing and try again, though something tells you, you should make sure your vulpine infection is not in full bloom, but your belly is round with a nice fat litter of cubs. Perhaps then this thing will yield to you? You ruminate, absentmindedly tracing your fingers along your bare throat. Till then, you might consider looking for a way to full unleash your [bold type]Inner Predator[roman type].";


