	say "      Your temperature starts to rise to a near feverish degree, fidgeting at the sudden rise, your eyes soon go wide as odorless steam starts to pour off your luxurious fur in thick velvety ribbons. Perturbed, but otherwise unharmed, you watch in quiet awe your cuddly body rapidly slimming down, growing sleek and tight in places. As you casually heft your dominant leg before yourself, observing the once luscious padding adoring your skull crushing thighs vanish amidst the plum of unusual vapor. While a sense of lightness grips your cuddly bump as your midriff loves its much of its [if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 2]curvy splendor[else if Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 3]bountiful bounce[end if]. You cast a worried look to your mist... er Snuggle, you correct yourself, as your vision clears. Likely feeling the weight of your gaze bearing down upon her, the doting goo snakes avatars outward upon a wafer thin neck to meet your gaze, cooing. 'Is something wrong precious?' Sighing, you roll your eye and tell this would be mistress-.";
