	say "    To say nothing of your curvy thighs and thong busting tush are like your personal throne. You purr, waggling your hips as mitts drift down your milfy flanks, groping a gleeful paw of juicy fluff. All of which is tied together with this big, sexy, baby bump, you pant, tail fluttering behind you as you comb your fingers through your majestic tummy fur. Delighting at the sensuous furrows cast by your digits as they glide along your cub swollen baby factory while you pamper the slumbering form of your cubs. Fuck its like your own peronal stress ball and arm rest rolled into one perfect foxy package. No matter how you look at it, her current gifts are more than enough for you, well for now. You gush, lolling back into the swaddling embrace of the affectionate gel. 'Y-you really mean all that?' Snuggle sniffles, her true body curling around you like a loving serpent. Yes mist- er Snuggle, you titter, fondly caressing her silky form.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     'Oh pet, you're so kind, we couldn't have asked for foxy to care for, but...' the goo girl, simpers, drawing herself all the more tightly about you. 'Good pets still need their treats so how about we give you a little 'boost' instead?' Snuggle chirps, as the puddling gel lingering in the depths of your belly jiggle excitedly. Uh, what kind of boost? You question, unsure what to make of her offer. 'Nothing special dear, just a simple jolt of helpful nanites to make our Pet make you even stronger. You never know when some mean old feral will try to hurt our precious girl,' she giggles, bobbing her avatar's head towards the wider city. Well, you guess that sounds ok but she promises not to change anymore, right? 'Of course pet, all we want is for our special girl to be the biggest, happiest, most snuggly mommy fox ever!' The overjoyed ooze preens, her true body rippling about you like a tidal swell.";
	say "     Grinning under her praise, you motion for the doting gel to continue, so long as she remembers her promise not to change you further well, you pause flashing her a cheerful smirk, not just yet at least. 'We promise dear, now sit back, this should only take a moment.' Snuggle coos, as the lingering bits of gel churning away within you begin to squirm in tune with the ripples of her true body. Mmhh, that feels kind of nice, almost like someone's hugging you, you purr, running your paws along the cushy hem of your immaculate middle, basking in the effervescent bliss roiling though as the waning dollops of syrupy delight trickle through you like an intoxicating sugar rush. In moments, your robust legs muscles throb with a sweltering vigor as hidden tissue grows all the tougher, to better support your voluptuous body and, some maternal facet of your mind crows, protecting your precious babes. As you lovingly draw an inquisitive talon along the cute little bulges in your delightfully active belly, watching the light play across your fur.";
	WaitLineBreak; 
	say "     Your vision seems to sharpen, as new hues dance along the edges of your awareness, hearing grows all the crisper, and even your olfactory senses bristle with a flood of information. All the while, your mind ripples with new exotic possibilities as the nascent data is dissected, compiled, and initiated into the swelling ocean of nanite-tainted understanding whorling though you as the unusual oozes essence surges through your cuddly body. Though the effects are rather short lived as the vivacious sensation burns out just as quickly, a tiny spark of this transcendental experience still clings to you as the last vestiges of the caring goo's meal dissolves away. Leaving only the familiar voracious pit in your belly as you turn your towards the rest of your lavish body, searching for any sign your prospective 'owner' might have left some surprises waiting for you.";
	say "     Yet, outside of some added shine to your fur, likely the results of her goopy affections, your body is just as pillowy and perfect as ever, you muse, lovingly running your paws along the border of your fur. 'Does pet like her gift?' Snuggle titters, while her avatar nuzzles its goopy muzzle up along your neck, kissing and nibbling your fur. Yes, you murmur, relishing odd oozes touch as her expansive body rocks you like a treasured kit. 'Good, with enough time,' your playful friend titters, drawing her elastic arms about your opulent curves, 'we can bestow this gift again and again if you like Pet, though the effects might now be as potent.' Oh... that does sound useful, you coo mischievously watching the doting gel's hand cheekily jostle your plush assets before you. 'Indeed sweetie, but we need a little something from you though,' Snuggle hums, as her faux-lips brush your ears.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     Name it, you purr, drawing your along the back of her head while you stroke her spongy ears. 'Such an eager girl, it's nothing much, just keep filling this big fluffy with prey, and make lots of tasty milk and cummies for Mistress. So can our good girl do that for her Mistress?' Snuggle says, giving your heft cream tanks [if Player is herm]and well-padded sack[end if] a gentle pat. Tailing wagging at her praise, you nod your head, telling her of course. You and your sweet kits are always hungry after all. You snicker, almost drooling at the thought of your next shared meal with your kits. '*Tee-hee*, we thought you might say that pet, just remember if you're able to turn a few broken broken foxes for us you won't need to hunt ever again. Then you can sit back in Mistress's arms and concentrate on being the bestest, strongest, smartest girl in the world.' Snuggle teases, her words coiling around you like lacy ribbons as you're drawn all the deeper into her comfy body. 'No more worries, fears, or responsibilities, just a nice pampered life full of love and all the power you could want, doesn't that sound grand?' she swoons with a subtle manic trill.";
	say "     Yes mistress, you unthinkingly murmur, as you monetarily close your eyes, imagining yourself floating forever more in her embrace, surrounded by all manner of doting vulpine minders eager to breed and feed your perfect body. 'Wonderful, now much as it pains us to part with our precious girl,' Snuggle huffs, gently righting your still tender body. 'We need you to go exploring once more, and make lots of helper foxes for us with those wonderful breasts of yours,' she tempts, caning her elastic neck down along your lustrous mounds, giving each one a reverent peck. 'Can you do that for Mistress dear?' Bobbing your head in the affirmative, you draw your vulpine tongue along your ebony lips, telling the loving goo you'll get right on as soon as you can. After all, you are more than a touch curious just what it will feel like to use your latest addition, you chuff, watching Snuggle's doll nuzzle your glowing pelt.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     'Marvelous, we knew our girl wouldn't let us down,' she swoons, lightly depositing you onto your paws with deliberate care. 'Of course, if pet has questions for us, or would like to have more fun before she marches off into the mean old city,' she motions towards the wider world with wave of quasi-formed tendril jutting from her ture body, 'Mistress will be happy to accommodate her.' Snuggle purrs, loosing her hold on you as she slinks back to one side waiting for your reply.";
