to say Leanfox:
	say "         Feeling a rare moment of mental clarity, you take a deep centering breath, then hiss at the clingy goo, demanding to know why in hell's bells she didn't tell you she could do this!? Sure there [italic type]might[roman type] have been some novelty to being a big blubbery vixen, but you would have really liked the option to slim your door jamming ass down a bit. Especially if it was that FREAKING EASY! You grumble, roughly thumping your tail against her gel-like body. 'Oh we're sorry dear, but we thought you liked our work,' Snuggle whimpers, her ears flattening down to the sides of her head. 'Besides we only did it to protect your cubs, and you seemed to enjoy being our big cuddly girl,' she adds gently, running her finger through tummy fur. 'Didn't it feel so nice to have all that fluff to rest your paws on? Maybe, you half-heartley huff, as she playfully jostles the tender dome of your lush preggy middle while your kits squirm beneath her touch. Though you'd have preferred she led with this option instead.";
	say "     '*Sigh* ok, if this is what Pet wants.' the goop fox pouts, as her body seems to deflate ever-so-slighty. It is, you grumble roughly pulling yourself out of clutches and bound onto the floor with a lighter airy swish. 'Pets not mad at us is she?' Snuggle peeps, a look of genuine hurt blossoming as her doll curls into a fetal ball and sinks into the bubbling folds it's true body like a spurned child. Shaking your head, you tell her no, you're more disappointed than anything else. 'Oh you wound us Pet, mistress only wants you to be happy, but if being thin will make you happy we can help it's just...' she babbles, pulling her legs tightly against herself. Just what, you ask? 'We need more wild nanites and Mistress isn't strong enough to get more for Pet yet.' Intrigued, you ask if you were able to consume a few foxes like she mentioned would she be able to do this trick again. 'Oh, yes of course Pet, but if you eat too many, well' she mews, casting a swift glance at your slimmed down tum. You'd balloon up all over again? 'Yeppers,' she mumbles dejectedly.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     Nodding sagaciously, you tell her you guess you'll keep that in mind the next time you head out for a snack, you snicker, idly licking your chops. 'Then Pet forgives us?' Snuggle sobs, though her tone brightens with soft hopeful notes. For now, and her other services still sound rather intriguing in their own right too. 'Oh thank you! We promise to do whatever we can to become the best Mistress for you.' Snuggle cheers, righting herself doll into a sitting position. Rather pleased, you stride forward to give the goo a pat on the head, relishing the gossamer kiss of her membrane greeting your paws while you inform her you're happy to help with that, despite this little rough patch. You do like her work thus far, and are more than a little curious what other tricks she can share with you. 'Pet is so kind,' she beams as you tussle her ears. Grinning, you bob your head toward the city, informing her you'll be taking your leave soon, after all prey don't catch themselves and there is whole crazy city to explore.";
	say "    'Of course, your and her babies must be so hungry,' Snuggle coos while a ravenous rumble flickers across your diminished middle. 'But if you has any questions for us, or,' she simpers, invitingly patting the ooze beside wobbling beneath her doll. 'Maybe pet would like to have some more fun with Mistress before she goes, we are always willing to accommodate her.' Doing a quick stretch, you tell her you'll think about it, while the odd ooze's doll simply bobs in place waiting on your decision.";
