to say Fluffyfox:
	say "     Looking down at your diminished, you can't help but grumble at the damage done to your milfy figure, sure this turned out great and all, but you're already regretting the loss of your stunning proportions. After all, the added pounds felt so right, to say nothing of that sexy bounce that followed your every step, or feeling the feeling of safety you experienced running your paws through all the cuddly pudge. Now, it almost hurts to gaze on your diminished figure, especially considering how hard you worked to earn your curves. Perhaps sensing your dismay, Snuggle rocks your famished form in her cushy embrace, murmuring. 'Is something wrong, we thought you were enjoying our work?' Sniffling, you tell it's not that, you love the new look, but you wish she warned you'd slim down like this. You rumble, gesturing to your somewhat trimmer form. 'Oh dear we're sorry but those mean old nanites we're being so stubborn we had to,' she pauses, ears twitching while she searches for the word, 'borrow some of your fluff to make them listen. Don't worry though,' she giggles, nuzzling her goopy whisker against your neck, ' your body will recover if you feed it lots of yummy vitamin fox.'";
	say "     Really, that sounds like a lot of work, besides you're already wasting away, you rumble in a coy sing-song trill. 'Oh don't be modest, we know how much you love filling this big greedy belly,' she coos, cupping her paws along the plush jiggly curves of your baby bump as she lightly rocks your ravenous middle before you. 'Just think how wonderful it will feel to have your prey thrashing and churning into delicious goopy for your babies, and these big sexy tits. Doesn't that sound grand dear?' Snuggle teases, while her mitts drift up to the inviting swell of your ample rack. Maybe, but you were hoping she could find some prey for you, or maybe work some her magic on you again. You purr, leaning into her touch.";
	WaitLineBreak;
	say "     'Would that we could, but Mistress isn't that strong yet, however,' she preens, drawing a gelatinous 'nail' along one of your perky nips. 'With a little help from your milk and maybe a few helpers, we could get you plenty of delicious prey whenever you wanted. Then you can just sit back in Mistress's arms like she deserves and focus on growing into the biggest, softest, most spoiled mommy fox ever.' the eager ooze trills. That does sound nice, you purr dreamily as stretch in her liquidic embrace. 'Oh course it does, you were made to be loved and pampered, we just need you to make us some assistants first. Now does Pet think she can do that for her Mistress?' Snuggle swoons, lifting you to your paws with surprising ease. Yes mist-! Er, you gulp, Snuggle. You peep, your face blushing a vibrant crimson. 'Good girl, we look forward to your return, though if you have any questions for us, or would like to play some more. You need only ask.' she tempts, lightly 'nibbling' on the nape of your neck.";
