				say "     Naughty boi, you trill, milk steaming down his soft sandy fur in an opalescent river as adrenaline laced nanite-tainted hormones coursing through your softening figure. Grinning, your phantom lover offers no reply, as he lightly nibbles on your ears with a lewd little chirp. Swooning at his boldness and gossamer kiss of his breath playing along your fur, you wrap your legs about his waist, evoking a pleasant yet surprised peep from the tiny fennec as you pull him closer. Delighting in the spicy scent pouring off his compact form greeting your [facename of Player] nose, as you encouragingly nuzzle the silky edges of his large vulpine ears, and unsubtle jiggle of your new curves playing across your senses with every buck of your hips. Till with an adorable little yip, your cunt tightens about his fingers like a living vice, you cum with a deep seed sigh, and feverish fantasy breaks like tule fog in the morning light. Panting, spent, and the perfect kind of sticky between the knees, you at last open your eyes and gaze at the cute curve of your lush foxy tits and tum bobbing before you. Ripe with fertile purpose, your gorgeous furry bump and scrumptious milk tanks, easily dominate much of your view, not that you'd have it any other way. You preen, letting your eyes wander the heavy swell of your maternal body, before you work yourself into a sitting position with your tummy neatly nestled between your legs.";
				WaitLineBreak;
				say "    You reach behind yourself, gently unzipping your suit with a proud languidness, reveling in the heady sight of plump fuzzy mounds and cuddly bump slipping free of its wondrous furry cocoon. Bet mommy's tummy must feel so comfy now eh babies, you swoon under your breath at the picturesque little swirl of foxy hair decorating your ripening navel as you run your paws along the voluminous curves of your growing kit factory. Reveling in the strangely comforting sensation of your pads sinking into the thin layer of mommy pudge and voluminous fur swaddling your [italic type]kits[roman type] as you draw your claws across their slumbering form. Oh and just feel how big you've all gotten! You pant, at the feeling of their lush weight of your brood pressing down on your pads. Guess these changes agree with you? You hum, exalting in the lovely kick and squirms of your greeting your mitts as your now slightly larger [italic type]cubs[roman type] affectionate grasp at your claws. *Tee-Hee*, well you're glad you like them, you giggle at the intoxicating rush of maternal hormones surging through you."; 
				say "     After all, you just know they'll make wonder vixens, you add, allowing your eyes to flicker along the matronly curves for vulpine mitts as you expectantly massage the lush contours off your fuzzy tum. To your far-traveled gaze, your fingers are a willowly blend canine and humanoid traits, masterfully suited for manipulation, yet still blessed with endearing pink heart-shaped pads, tipped with glossy claws almost made for subuding mate, or some bestial side of you whispers, prey. At the thought of digging your talons into the shoulder of some hapless feral as you ride them raw. While your arms are soft and motherly with just the barest hints of lush cushy adipose, concealing a hidden layer of hardened muscle breathing its cuddly exterious. You muse, eyes drifting to the plush curves of your alabaster tips and gleaming ebony nips as they lazy atop your well-padded tum, casting tiny but by no means unsightly furrows in your bump.";
				WaitLineBreak;
				say "     Even now, you hear the hearty slosh of your cream serenading your ears with the slightest provocation as you cup your paws about about their engorged majesty, impossibly full, your perky teats tiny droplets of ambrosia dribble from your ducts. Catching a few errant beads along the crook of your claw, you bring them to your unchanged lips and at the lusterous cream with a happy purr. Mh, you girls are going to love this, you preen through a soft canine rumble, at the warm rich fatty sapor of your cream basting your palate while you gently lapping at the sweet little morsel gracing your talons, before turning your attention to your altered legs. You find it hard not admire their striking bestial stance and plush shapley padding decorating your limbs as you playfully shuffle your legs along the fluffy curves of your sexy bump. By no means portly, your foxy legs straddle the line between glorious thicc and divinely toned, yet still imparting just the right amount of sensual jiggle to your every motion.";
				say "     While still maintaining a subtle layer of sculpted muscle that could crack a Wildcat's skull with a single squeeze. You think to yourself in base contentment at the intoxicating caress of your lovely bump playing across your limbs at thought of pinning some ";
				if "Vore Predator" is listed in Feats of Player:
					say "delicious prey thing beneath your nice fluffy rumbly tumby as your legs squeeze their sides. Even your voracious kits seem to enjoy the notion, while they wriggle and squirm in mutual predatory delight. Oh don't worry babies, mommy will catch a nice tasty feral for you soon, you coo reassuringly, giving your tum a well-deserved rub. After all, wonderful vixens like them need all the food they can get so they can grow into big, strong, sexy preds like their mommy. You pant, tongue briefly lolling from the side of your mouth at the thought of churning away some luckless feral, before turning your gaze towards your pawbs.";
				else:
					say "nice fuck meat beneath you as you claim yet another warm load for your insatiable body. Bet you little vixens would love that wouldn't you? You hum, imagining some buffy Alpha Husky, or ripped Wrestling Wolf squirming under the weight of your plush belly, while their bestial fur rifling yours as you milk those big juicy puppy peckers for all they're worth. All the while, your slutty cubs quicken in shared excitement as molten beads of girly drip from your [cunt size desc of Player] folds. Thought so, you widdle monsters are going to make great breeders, just like your mommy, you smirk, turning your gaze towards your pawbs.";
				WaitLineBreak;
				say "     Petie and sleek, your jet black digi petes positively brim with vixen's vigor as you give your adorable toes a well-pleased flex, exalting in the unbound rush of energy coursing through you, alongside the ambient softness of your cute pink jelly beanie pads. Your glossy ebony nail simmers with an eerily beautiful glow all their own as you tilt them into the available light. Already, a part of you is looking forward to walking your new paws, perhaps, a deviant side of you tempts, having some hunky canine give them a loving rub, or giving a subby herm a tender paw job as shi writhes beneath you like a good little bitch. Of course, you ruminate, sparing a glance at your unaltered ass and the faux tail sitting nearby, you still have more changes ahead of you before your foxy form is completed. Hopefully, it won't be too long, your kits deserve a chance to grow up as slutty vixen just like their cuddly mother, you opine, cheerfully massages your paws about the fuzzy swell of your baby bump. For now though, you simply have to wait for your costume to work its magic on you again, then you can seek out [italic type]your[roman type] head and at last become the sexy mommy fox you were meant to be. You preen, as you collect your things and zip yourself once more into the welcoming furrows of your prize, before heading off on your business once more.";
