				now Scalevalue of Player is 3;
		else:
			say "     Trekking though the city in rare moment of peaceful solitude, you find yourself idly running your gloved mitts along the bestial curves of your prized find's digi legs. Just as smooth and pristine as the day you found it, the thing's fur comforting presence is something you've come to rely on. Though a curious side of you still can't help but wonder how long it will be till the next wave of change crashes over you. You muse, watching your gloves faux claws carve cute little furrows in your pelt-to-be as you pace about the area like a child waiting on their holiday presents. It shouldn't be long now, after all your initial changes only took a day or so to manifest, surely your next transformation is just around the corner? You hum, drumming your [bodyname of Player] toes along the satin padding of your boots in base contentment at the pleasant doughy feeling of the fake paw's supple pads supporting you as the endearing fabric seems to grip you all the tighter. More than used to such oddities, your lips curl into a blissful dreamy grin as you whisper, its happening, under your breath in raw delight.";
			say "     Your faux-pelt writhes with the uncountable impression of the lovely feelers wriggling along the cushy core of your suit. you run your gloved mitts over their strange fluidic forms, relishing the endearing sensation of their adorable lengths cascading over you. Rather squishy to the touch, these unseen tendrils seem to lean into your caress, as their [']heads['] wriggle affectionately about your fingers as they slowly peak out from the subtle seams of your chosen attire, coiling about your [breast size desc of Player] chest and midriff like doting serpents. Ha that tickles, you hum, watching them slowly spreading across outward, coating your eager form in their loving, tentacular embrace. Kneading and massaging your receptive being in a soothing tattoo all their own as they pour across your core. Mmh, feels so good, you purr, easing yourself to the ground to better enjoy their earnest attention. Now come on little guys, hurry up and change me! you pant, gently tracing a gloved mitt along their squiggly tepid bodies while they slowly work their way down around your arms and legs.";
			WaitLineBreak;
			if SkinName of Player is "Snuggle Fox":
				say "     As they pet your foxy pelt in a perplexing mix of reverent delight and curiosity, almost like they were, you pause, searching for a feeling to put to their touch, surprised to see you've managed to maintain their gift. Aw how could you sweeties really think you'd part with this lovely fur? Why, it'd be criminal to let some silly feral seperate you from this, and besides, it feels so good how could you ever go back to anything else? You tease, playfully drumming your fingers along the backs while they squirm about your fingers with tender alacrity, sending heady pulses of static delight flickering through at your show of application for their work. Well you're welcome you widdle dears, you beam gently nuzzling your cheeks against them, watching their glossy forms creep down towards your feet.";
			else:
				say "     Invigorating pinpricks of morphic desire flares across your hide like the warm rays of the noonday sun pouring over you as your fox pelt spreads outward once more. Though you can't help but notice linger notes of, you hesitate, struggling to put a word to their motions, aggravation? You muse at the growing roughness of their touch as your vulpine pelt seeps across you like oil flowing over water. Feeling oddly bashful at potentially slighting your suit's unseen passengers, you quickly mutter a simple apology to them, assuring the hard working feelers you never meant part with your fur so casually. As the nanites are, you note, rather virulent, and maintaining your form is... challenging these days. Quizzically, they seem to accept your words at face value, as the budding harshness of their touch gives way to same inquisitive glee you felt not so long ago as they creep down towards your feet.";
			say "     Your core begins to go devilishly hot to the touch, as sweet smelling steam pours from you suit as your body starts to change beneath its satin cocoon. Dimly as you observe the fleeting white wisps coiling about you, you'd almost swear you can feel the fat boiling off your body while the changes take hold. In its place, vigor like you've scarcely dreamed surges across your slimming middle as tight, shapely bestial muscle rushes into to its like tempered steel being poured into a mold. As your tum and waist shrink, then compress into a lithe feminine hourglass, graced with just the barest hints of sinew peeking through your dense fuzzy fur. You ruminate, cheerfully running your mitts along the hale contours of once [bodydesc of Player] form while the lean, dense predatory sinew filters down your leg in regal tide. As your bones creak and flesh constricts, before flowing into a proper digitigrade bend befitting a ";
			if "Vore Predator" is listed in Feats of Player:
				say "proud foxy huntress like yourself. ";
			else:
				say "spritely vixen in the making like yourself. ";
			WaitLineBreak;
			say "     Some giddy effervescent side of you quips, as your suit's cuddly padding and loving tendrils grip your shifting thighs, almost guiding their changes with their touch while they strain against the silky fabric. Ah don't stop, you yip in vulpine ecstasy at the kiss of the unseen of the feeler traipsing about your paws-to-be while the blissful heat pooling about your thighs flows further south. Coddling your tender toes in a blessedly thermocline of desire as the unearthly warmth of your transformation blends with the tepid strokes of these felicitous feelers in a lurid waltz cascading over your extremities while they grow slender and refined. Soft, supple pads flare into being along the balls of your changing feet as they steadily fill the cushy contours of your elastic boots, meanwhile your nails ripple outward hardening into curved glossy claws. Clicking them against one another as the endearing feelers massage your changing paws, you can't wait to put these though their paces, you swoon at the thought of tracing your claws into some hapless husky bitch glossy puppy pus as she squirms beneath you. Or perhaps, a deviant voice tempts, giving some strapping canine the paw job of his life, while enticing images of some hunky wolf panting at the silken kiss of your pads caressing his yummy doggy dick dances across the edges of your mind.";
			say "     Almost gushing at the notion, and blissed out expression on the dreamy lupine's face and ghostly throb of knot gracing your paws, you hardly notice the changes simmering across your arms as the change seeps along them. Though subtle at first, the same vixen's vigor that filled your legs gradually builds along them as any fat or weakness that once dared mar your nascent vulpine body evaporates under the tactile caress of your suit's inquisitive tendrils. Fresh bursts of sweet smelling steam billows through the seams of your costume as proud sculpted muscle billows down your arms, your hands begin to perspire and convolve with fresh untapped potential. Clenching them, you can feel the first wisps of your pads roiling along your palms as the your parts ever-so-slightly, revealing a fetching layer of plush silky furry padding creeping up your fingers. At their apex, your digits narrow and tiny talons burst forth, no larger than any you've seen on any of the local canines, though still glassy smooth to the touch, their addition will no doubt improve your grip. You opine, idly toying with the notion of sink your new found claws into some ";
			if "Vore Predator" is listed in Feats of Player:
				say "yummy prey things neck, ";
			else:
				say "adorable little fuck meat sides, ";
			say "while the tendrils engulfing your body grow placid, then retract with an affectionate slowness as their seemingly spent forms retract back from whence they came.";
			WaitLineBreak;
			say "     Another time, you might have considered stopping them, or perhaps resorting to more... kinetic means of asserting where they came from, such thoughts are the furthest from your mind as you giddily strip down, then bask at the sight of your shapely vixen body. Divinely curvy, yet supremely hale, your hardened core would be the envy of any model as your trim hourglass build is the very picture of feminine grace with just the barest hints of muscle coddling your midriff. Neither off putting or mannish, the added sinew is almost as inviting to the eye as it is to the touch. You think to yourself, admiring Reddish-orange fur gleaming along your flanks, while a gentle dusting of nacre white bejewels your [breast size desc of Player] chest and flat toned tum.";
			say "     Tilting your gaze south, it's hard not purr at the regal spectacle of your sculpted digi-legs and cute willowy thighs, neatly suited for survival and more... carnal endeavors, your chiseled calves can just as easily sprint a mile as crush an alpha wolf's skull between their stately length. Your jet black paws meanwhile are perfect for worship and work, you muse, exalting in the simple pleasure of rocking on your cushy pads as you lightly rake your brilliant onyx talon along the ground while urge to sprint off into distance in search of continent feral to test yourself against nips at the back of your mind. Tempting as it may be, you push back against the urge, if only for them to bring your attention to arms, much in the order of your legs, they seem built for conquest and pleasure in equal measure. As the lithe hills and tender valleys of bestial muscle adorn your ripple with potential as you flex your arm in base admiration of your foxy physique.";
			WaitLineBreak;
			say "    Your hands meanwhile are an efficient amalgam of vulpine and hominid traits, with cute protective pads, silky black fur, and strong subtle claws that maintain the same dexterity your silly little human mitts once boasted. Yet, as you drink in the wondrous sheen of your fur and talon, you can't help but look forward to what future changes await you. You muse, sparing a quick glance back at your [TailName of Player] ass, and your suit's tail sitting on the ground not too far from you. Soon enough though, the suit will finish the job, then you'll seek out [italic type]your[roman type] head and become the vixen you were always meant to be, you chuckle as you dress yourself once more then return to your day.";
