			now Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 2;
			now Dexterity of Mistress snuggle is 0;
		-- "Three Pr.":
			say "Done.";
			now Perception of Mistress Snuggle is 3;
			now Dexterity of Mistress snuggle is 0;
		-- "Dex one.":
